//@version=6
indicator("QORE CRT RADAR + CHART | 34 mercados V34.12U IC QA", shorttitle="QORE CRT 34+Chart 12U", overlay=true, max_lines_count=8, max_labels_count=12, max_boxes_count=5, dynamic_requests=true)

// MODULO 5B CANDIDATO V34.10b NO INTEGRADO: manejo conservador de pausas de sesion. Requiere auditoria TradingView.
// MODULO 5A INTEGRADO (AUTORIZADO): deteccion interna FVG H1/H4. Validacion TradingView pendiente.
// MODULO 4B INTEGRADO (AUTORIZADO): estado PDH/PDL, primera barrida y dashboard 6 columnas.
// MODULO 4A AUTORIZADO: PDH/PDL NY usando M5 cerradas; niveles internos, sin senales.
// MODULO 3B.3B AUTORIZADO: expiracion y prioridad Inside Bar, sin cambiar MSS/dashboard.
// MODULO 2B AUTORIZADO: CRT_2C_RETURN estructural y CRT_2C_EXPANSION solo diagnostico.
// MODULO 1 APROBADO: CONTROL DE CONTINUIDAD DE VELAS M5 EN H4.
// V34.1 AUDITORIA: correcciones de invalidacion C3 H4 y prioridad de candidatos.
// PARCHE ESTATICO. Compilacion/ejecucion TradingView pendiente.
// V34 - CAMBIO CRITICO: TODAS LAS H4 del ciclo NY se analizan como C1.
// No se filtra por tres inicios predefinidos: FX 01/05/09/13/17/21,
// indices 02/06/10/14/18/22. Sigue existiendo modo estricto opcional.
// CRT provisional en C2, ratificado SOLO con cierre H4 de C2 dentro C1.
// MSS M5 y M15 independientes y asociados a la barrida del mismo ciclo.
// Analizar cada vela H4 no equivale a validar cualquier vela como CRT.
// V34 no ha sido compilada dentro de Pine Editor: validacion real pendiente.
// V32 30-OCT-2026: reparar visibilidad del activo abierto y CRT H4
// Detectar durante C2, diferenciar provisional (*) de ratificado y
// conservar el ultimo CRT confirmado por ventana parametrizable.
// El grafico abierto va primero si el proveedor/ticker coincide exactamente con un feed.
// IMPORTANTE: motor independiente. No copia el Pine cerrado de GoldForexDoc.
// V31: SCAN de 34 simbolos configurables + grafico abierto independiente.
// Todos usan el MISMO f_engine() y la MISMA fuente M5; sin exclusiones de pares.
// Dashboard seleccionable: solo CRT o auditoria de todos los simbolos por pagina.
// NO garantiza vigilar todo el universo TradingView: los limites de peticiones aplican.
// V30: motor original implementado a partir de las REGLAS PUBLICADAS, NO es una copia
// exacta de los codigos de GoldForexDoc ni swordNshield.
// UN motor por simbolo en M5: agrega C1/C2/C3 H4 y MSS M15, preservando MSS M5.
// V34: se observan TODAS las H4 del ciclo NY; 3 origenes es modo opcional.
// C2 barre UN limite de C1; regresa a C1 y debe CERRAR dentro. C3 expande.
// MSS = cierre que cruza swing confirmado ANTES de la barrida C2.
// Las confirmaciones M5/M15 del mismo CRT y direccion quedan latched.
// No usa barstate.isconfirmed dentro de request.security: analiza M5 [1] CERRADA.
// RADAR A: monitor de 34 mercados; CHART B: dibujos CRH/CRL y MSS del grafico.
// En M15 y H4, request.security(..., "5") entrega un ESTADO calculado en M5
// pero el refresco/reconciliacion intrabar requiere comprobarlo en TradingView.


// QA V34.12I / MEMORIA: RADAR consulta 34 feeds por defecto (experimental).
// BTCUSD solo es modo manual de diagnostico; snapshot no certifica memoria
// ni resuelve por si solo "Memory limits exceeded" en TradingView/Android.
// Esta version NO autoriza enviar alertas a Android o trading live.
// El candidato V34.10b oficial de comparacion permanece inalterado.

string TZ = "America/New_York"
int MIN5 = 300000
int MIN15 = 900000
int H4MS = 14400000

string grp = "01 / Logica CRT"
idxList = input.string("USTEC,NAS100USD,US500,US30,US100,SPX500,US2000,DE40,GER40,UK100,JP225,HK50,NAS100,SPX,NDX,DJI,ES1!,NQ1!,YM1!", "Indices por ticker (CSV)", group=grp)
// V34.12R: unico escaneo: las SEIS velas H4 de cada ciclo de 24 horas.
allowTouches = input.bool(true, "Considerar toque CRH/CRL como candidato", group=grp, tooltip="Los toques exactos se muestran PROVISIONALES; el cierre H4 de C2 dentro de C1 es obligatorio para ratificar. Desactivar para exigir barrida estricta.")
// V34.11k: C1/C2/C3/Inside require a CLOSED 48-M5 contiguous H4.
// No minimum-bar override: a partially observed four-hour candle
// must NEVER enter the sovereign CRT or an Inside validation.
showCandidate = input.bool(true, "Mostrar CRT C2 provisional (con *)", group=grp)
showAtSweep = input.bool(true, "Mostrar barrida C2 antes del retorno (provisional *)", group=grp, tooltip="El toque del rango H4 no es confirmacion CRT; se identifica con * y no se le asignan MSS futuros. Debe retornar al rango para ratificarse.")
keepLastCRT = input.bool(false, "Conservar ultimo CRT ratificado (HISTORICO QA)", group=grp, tooltip="Memoria visual de maximo 48 horas por defecto, separada del CRT vigente; la etiqueta indica HIST y nunca confirma una nueva entrada.")
keepHours = input.int(48, "Memoria ultimo CRT (horas)", minval=4, maxval=120, group=grp)
// M3B.3B: vigencia en H4 de negociacion cerradas y verificadas.
maxH4Life = input.int(3, "Vida Inside Bar (H4 cerradas)", minval=1, maxval=10, group=grp)

// QA: detectar varias familias de CRT NO autoriza entradas automaticamente.
string grp2 = "02 / MSS M5 y M15"
left5 = input.int(2, "M5 swing izquierdo", minval=1, maxval=7, group=grp2)
right5 = input.int(2, "M5 swing derecho", minval=1, maxval=7, group=grp2)
left15 = input.int(2, "M15 swing izquierdo", minval=1, maxval=7, group=grp2)
right15 = input.int(2, "M15 swing derecho", minval=1, maxval=7, group=grp2)
maxPivotAge = input.int(720, "Max edad del swing antes de barrida (min)", minval=15, maxval=1440, group=grp2)

// V34.10t: los 34 simbolos se recorren por DEFECTO.
// BTCUSD solo es un modo manual de emergencia para recursos limitados.
// El modo 34 NO certifica que cada mercado produzca un CRT vigente.
string grpMemory = "00 / Memoria (QA)"
memoryScan = input.string("34 instrumentos (experimental)", "Alcance escaneo", options=["34 instrumentos (experimental)", "BTCUSD solo"], group=grpMemory, tooltip="Predeterminado: solicitar los 34 simbolos y ejecutar el mismo f_engine() en cada feed M5. BTCUSD solo es un modo manual de diagnostico y NO escanea los otros 33. 34 respuestas no equivalen a 34 modelos detectados ni validados.")
bool scanAll = memoryScan == "34 instrumentos (experimental)"
string grp3 = "03 / Dashboard y auditoria QA"
showDashboard = input.bool(true, "Mostrar dashboard", group=grp3)
expandFull34 = input.bool(false, "Ver los 34 instrumentos (expandir)", group=grp3, tooltip="En TradingView Pine las celdas no reciben toques. Abre Ajustes del indicador > 03 / Dashboard y activa esto. Vista compacta: solo CRT centrales ratificados, priorizando MSS M15; ampliada: los 34 feeds, con o sin señal, 4 por pagina.")
compactPriorityRows = input.int(6, "Monitor CRT: filas prioritarias (2-6)", minval=2, maxval=6, group=grp3, tooltip="Solo para el monitor CRT + MSS compacto. Ordena primero los mercados con ambos MSS, despues M15, M5 y otros CRT. No altera los 34 feeds ni activa alertas.")
showCatalog7 = input.bool(false, "Ampliado: inspeccionar 7 categorias CRT (QA)", group=grp3, tooltip="Solo tiene efecto en modo ampliado: 3C+MSS15, 2C candidata, expansion rechazada, Inside retorno, Inside continuacion no aprobada, Multi-Candle QA y retest M15 QA. No crea entradas ni alertas.")
qaFamilyHistoryView = input.bool(false, "QA: historial 2C/3C/Inside/Multi por mercado", group=grp3, tooltip="Pantalla separada del monitor: 34 fuentes / 4 paginas con ultimo evento historico por familia en DD/MM UTC. Nunca presenta historico como CRT actual ni como MSS confirmado. Usa QA: numero de instrumento (1-34) para UTCmin exacto.")
qaHistoryFollowChart = input.bool(true, "QA historial: seguir el simbolo del grafico (mismo broker)", group=grp3, tooltip="Para el detalle de UTCmin toma el simbolo exacto del grafico solo si ticker.standard coincide en proveedor y simbolo con uno de los 34 feeds. Si no coincide: SIN SLOT. Desactiva para elegir el numero de instrumento manualmente.")
showNonBtcCohortQA = input.bool(false, "QA: auditar los 33 instrumentos sin BTC", group=grp3, tooltip="Muestra 33 feeds sin BTCUSD, por 4 por pagina: H4 evaluadas/incompletas, C1 validas y estados. BTC mantiene motor independiente y no participa en estadistica.")
qa33RootView = input.bool(true, "QA 33: mostrar causas H4 (inicio/fin/conteo)", group=grp3, tooltip="En la auditoria 33 alterna al desglose POR instrumento: bloques con inicio de NY distinto, fin diferente y cantidad M5 distinta de 48. No modifica reglas CRT.")
qaPhase1NonBtc = input.bool(true, "QA: fase M5 por feed 0..4m (SIN ALERTAS)", group=grp3, tooltip="Solo QA: utiliza la fase M5 cerrada 0,1,2,3,4 minutos del propio proveedor para reconstruir H4, H1 y M15 de cada feed NO BTC. Exige 48 M5 contiguas y pivote MSS15 propio. Nunca certifica H4 NY original, no muestra senales operativas ni permite alertas.")
showSlotEventAudit = input.bool(false, "QA: ver tiempos CRT/MSS de 1 instrumento", group=grp3, tooltip="Esta vista desplaza temporalmente el catalogo 34: muestra solo el evento actual. Para el ultimo evento historico, activar la opcion inferior; no autoriza trading.")
qaHistoricLast = input.bool(false, "QA: ver ultimo evento historico por categoria", group=grp3, tooltip="En la vista de tiempos, reemplaza los contadores inferiores por las marcas de tiempo mas recientes de 2C provisional, 2C ratificada, expansion rechazada, 3C, Inside retorno/continuacion, Multi4/Multi-N y retest M15. Nunca reconstruye ni inventa MSS15. No es certificado.")
qaReadableUtc = input.bool(true, "QA: mostrar fechas UTC (DD/MM HH:mm)", group=grp3, tooltip="Solo cambia la presentacion: ON = fecha UTC legible para Android; OFF = minutos Unix UTC exactos de V34.11L para reconciliacion con Trader Lab. Sin cambios de motor, velas, MSS o alertas.")
qaFollowChart = input.bool(true, "QA: seguir grafico solo si proveedor coincide", group=grp3, tooltip="Solo cambia el slot QA automaticamente si el ticker estandar con proveedor coincide exactamente con un feed del escaner. Nunca mezcla proveedores con el mismo nombre de mercado.")
qaEventSlot = input.int(1, "QA: numero de instrumento (1-34)", minval=1, maxval=34, group=grp3)
page = input.int(1, "Pagina si hay mas senales", minval=1, maxval=34, group=grp3)

// V34.12K QA: Chart B integrado en el MISMO indicador (plan Basic, un script).
// Dibuja solo el mercado abierto si coincide ticker + proveedor con un slot.
string grpChart = "04 / Chart integrado (QA, mercado abierto)"
showIntegratedChart = input.bool(true, "Dibujar CRT y MSS en el grafico abierto", group=grpChart, tooltip="Reutiliza el Signal del mismo slot entre los 34 feeds. Sin coincidencia exacta de proveedor/ticker, NO dibuja para evitar atribucion falsa.")
showLevels = input.bool(true, "CRH/CRL del C1 validado (QA)", group=grpChart)
showMssLines = input.bool(true, "Lineas MSS M5 y M15 propias", group=grpChart, tooltip="MSS solo del mismo modelo, con pivote previo a barrida. M15 naranja si el nivel esta pendiente y azul tras cierre M15 confirmado.")

// V34.12O: referencia grafica PDH/PDL = 1D PREVIA CONFIRMADA,
// exactamente el diario del ticker que el Owner compara en TradingView.
// La antigua referencia RTH/17 NY queda SOLO interna al motor CRT.
// No altera C1/C2/C3, ni MSS, ni agregados del dashboard.
showChartPDHPDL = input.bool(true, "PDH/PDL = 1D anterior confirmada (QA)", group=grpChart, tooltip="En H4 usa HIGH/LOW del 1D confirmado ANTERIOR del mismo ticker/proveedor, NO reconstruccion RTH/NY con M5; compara con la vela 1D visible en TradingView. No altera la liquidez interna del CRT.")
showChartH4Fvg = input.bool(true, "Mostrar FVG H4 CERCANOS al precio (QA)", group=grpChart, tooltip="FVG nativos del ticker abierto, solo 3 H4 cerradas consecutivas, ordenados por distancia al precio. Si el precio se aleja, el FVG pierde relevancia en pantalla.")
chartFvgLookbackH4 = input.int(24, "FVG H4: buscar entre ultimas H4 CERRADAS", minval=3, maxval=40, group=grpChart)
chartFvgMaxZones = input.int(1, "FVG H4: zonas cercanas visibles (1 a 3)", minval=1, maxval=3, group=grpChart)
chartFvgMaxAtr = input.float(1.5, "FVG H4: maxima distancia ATR", minval=0.25, maxval=5.0, step=0.25, group=grpChart, tooltip="Excluir FVG lejanos; la distancia se mide en ATR H4 confirmado del ticker, no en el rango CRT.")




// M4A PDH/PDL, diagnostico interno. NO dibuja niveles ni cambia senales.
string grpPdh = "05 / PDH y PDL"
useExtIdx = input.bool(false, "Indices: 17:00-17:00 NY (alternativa a RTH)", group=grpPdh, tooltip="RTH predeterminado 09:30-16:00 NY. El horario extendido real puede diferir segun el indice/proveedor.")

f_index() =>
    string name = str.upper(syminfo.ticker)
    string csv = "," + str.upper(str.replace_all(idxList, " ", "")) + ","
    bool listed = str.contains(csv, "," + name + ",")
    bool typical = str.contains(name, "USTEC") or str.contains(name, "NAS100") or str.contains(name,"US100") or str.contains(name,"US500") or str.contains(name,"SPX500") or str.contains(name,"US30") or str.contains(name,"US2000") or str.contains(name,"DE40") or str.contains(name,"GER40") or str.contains(name,"UK100") or str.contains(name,"JP225") or str.contains(name,"HK50")
    syminfo.type == "index" or listed or typical

f_allowed(int hh, bool indexFamily) =>
    // Ancla horaria NY NO equivale a operar solo la SESION de Nueva York.
    // Todos los 6 bloques H4 del ciclo de 24h son elegibles por defecto,
    // incluyendo Asia, Londres y NY; el motor siempre valida 48 M5
    // contiguas, CRH/CRL y C2 cerrada por separado.
    // Solo 6/6 H4, incluye Asia/Londres/NY. Sin selector de 3 ventanas.
    indexFamily ? (hh == 2 or hh == 6 or hh == 10 or hh == 14 or hh == 18 or hh == 22) : (hh == 1 or hh == 5 or hh == 9 or hh == 13 or hh == 17 or hh == 21)

// BTC: construir H4 desde la HORA LOCAL NY de CADA M5, nunca
// desde time("240", "0100-0100...") que en la salida DST puede
// anclar a 00/04/08 y saltarse C1 01/05/09. Anclas validas de
// cualquier dia: 01/05/09/13/17/21. De 00:00 a 00:59 corresponde
// al bloque 21:00 del DIA NY ANTERIOR.
// En el retroceso DST, 01:00 ocurre dos veces; las M5 del bloque
// excederan 48 y las puertas de C1/C2/C3 bloquearan el CRT.
f_btc_crt_h4_ny(int t) =>
    int hr = hour(t, TZ)
    int bucketHr = hr >= 21 ? 21 : hr >= 17 ? 17 : hr >= 13 ? 13 : hr >= 9 ? 9 : hr >= 5 ? 5 : hr >= 1 ? 1 : 21
    // Solo 00 NY pertenece al dia previo; -12 horas garantiza
    // fecha NY anterior aun en transiciones DST.
    int dateRef = hr == 0 ? t - 12 * 3600000 : t
    timestamp(TZ, year(dateRef, TZ), month(dateRef, TZ), dayofmonth(dateRef, TZ), bucketHr, 0)

// V34.11f: NON-BTC markets have a dedicated NY anchoring function.
// Forex and metals are checked independently from BTCUSD; the latter
// keeps its original clock and validation. Trading session coverage for
// XAU/XAG is NOT assumed equivalent to liquid Forex.
f_forex_metal_crt_h4_ny(int t) =>
    int hr = hour(t, TZ)
    int bucketHr = hr >= 21 ? 21 : hr >= 17 ? 17 : hr >= 13 ? 13 : hr >= 9 ? 9 : hr >= 5 ? 5 : hr >= 1 ? 1 : 21
    int dateRef = hr == 0 ? t - 12 * 3600000 : t
    timestamp(TZ, year(dateRef, TZ), month(dateRef, TZ), dayofmonth(dateRef, TZ), bucketHr, 0)

// V34.11e: deterministic index H4 alignment on NY 02/06/10/14/18/22.
// 00:00-01:59 NY belongs to yesterday's 22:00 H4.
// A nonexistent NY 02:00 DST spring anchor cannot be made a valid C1
// by relaxing the 48-M5-contiguous candle gate.
f_index_crt_h4_ny(int t) =>
    int hr = hour(t, TZ)
    int bucketHr = hr >= 22 ? 22 : hr >= 18 ? 18 : hr >= 14 ? 14 : hr >= 10 ? 10 : hr >= 6 ? 6 : hr >= 2 ? 2 : 22
    int dateRef = hr < 2 ? t - 12 * 3600000 : t
    timestamp(TZ, year(dateRef, TZ), month(dateRef, TZ), dayofmonth(dateRef, TZ), bucketHr, 0)

// Un campo = un estado de un solo CRT. Esta UDT elude el limite de 127
// elementos que impediria empaquetar 34 tuplas grandes por separado.
// One extra nested object in the security Signal. Its OHLC always
// belongs to the selected family's own C1, never the unrelated 2C C1.
type FamilyVisual
    int c1Start
    float c1High
    float c1Low
    int eventClosedAt
    int direction
    string kind
    bool structuralQA

type Signal
    int phase        // 0 sin CRT, 1 C2 provisional, 2 C3 ratificado, 3 ultimo ratificado
    int direction    // +1 bullish, -1 bearish
    int c1Start
    float crh
    float crl
    int sweepAt
    int m5At
    int m15At
    float m5Level
    float m15Level
    int m5PivotAt
    int m15PivotAt
    string modelKind        // PENDING, CRT_2C_RETURN, CRT_2C_EXPANSION, NONE
    bool isPatternValid    // Independiente de MSS M5/M15
    // M4B: campos de liquidez calculados en el mismo feed M5.
    string pdhStatus       // N/D / INTACTO / TAKEN
    string pdlStatus
    int pdhSweepAt        // Fin de la primera vela M5 que tomo la referencia
    int pdlSweepAt
    int pdhSweepStage     // 0=sin CRT asignable; 2=C2; 3=C3
    int pdlSweepStage
    int pdhSweepC1        // Identidad C1 congelada durante primera barrida
    int pdlSweepC1
    int crtC2Start        // Inicio real de C2 para distinguir PRE de C2
    int crtRatifiedAt     // Inicio C3 cuando la C2 H4 fue ratificada; base temporal de alertas
    int liquidityRefAt    // Timestamp de cierre de la sesion de referencia
    bool pdhSweptDuringCRT
    bool pdlSweptDuringCRT
    // QA-only payload del ultimo FVG H1/H4.
    int fvgH1Count
    int fvgH1StateCode
    float fvgH1Top
    float fvgH1Bottom
    float fvgH1Pen
    int fvgH1FormAt
    int fvgH1GapAt
    int fvgH4Count
    int fvgH4StateCode
    float fvgH4Top
    float fvgH4Bottom
    float fvgH4Pen
    int fvgH4FormAt
    int fvgH4GapAt
    // QA BTC: inicio UNIX del bloque NY y numero de M5 cerradas.
    int nyH4Start
    int nyH4M5Count
    // Valores BTC NY de referencia, mismos M5 del proveedor.
    float nyPDH
    float nyPDL
    int nyPDHReferenceAt
    // Estado corriente del día del PROVEEDOR 1D a partir de M5 cerradas.
    // Este es independiente de la sesión NY usada para CRT H4.
    int chartDStart
    float chartDayHighM5
    float chartDayLowM5
    bool chartDayContinuous
    // Solo observabilidad BTC: no convierten una barrida en senal.
    int qaC1Ready
    int qaC2Ratified
    string qaLastC2Gate
    int qaCurrentH4Hour
    // La ultima vela M15 COMPLETA y CERRADA, independiente del MSS M5.
    int qaLastClosedM15At
    // Modelo actual unicamente: diagnostico != entrada confirmada.
    string entryFamily
    string entryStage
    int entryConfirmedAt
    string insideFamilyDiag
    string insideStageDiag
    string multi4Kind
    int multi4DetectedAt
    string retest15State
    int retest15At
    float retest15High
    float retest15Low
    float retest15Close
    float retest15Pivot
    // QA: morfologias extra H4 cerradas; NO autoriza MSS ni alertas.
    string extraFamilyKind
    bool extraFamilyValid
    int extraFamilyC1
    int extraFamilyDirection
    int extraFamilyRatifiedAt
    string multiNKind
    int multiNAt
    // MSS15 propio de la familia seleccionada: no heredar 2C/3C.
    int extraFamilySweepAt
    float extraFamilyM15Pivot
    int extraFamilyM15PivotAt
    int extraFamilyM15At
    int extraFamilyM15C1
    // Conteos historicos por CONTEXTO del feed M5 realmente cargado,
    // no 34 señales ni certificacion de todos los mercados.
    int audit2C
    int audit3C
    int auditInside
    int auditM4
    int auditMN
    int auditC2Data
    int auditC2Double
    int auditC2NoSweep
    int auditC2Outside
    int auditC2Hour
    int auditC3Invalid
    int auditInsideData
    int auditInsideDouble
    int auditInsideOther
    int auditInsideExpire
    int auditMNNoTerminal
    int auditMNDouble
    int auditMNOutside
    int auditH4Incomplete
    int auditH4DST
    int auditH4Session
    int auditH4Internal
    // QA solo: un motivo excluyente por H4 que inicia a hora C1.
    int auditC1H4Closed
    int auditC1HourCandidates
    int auditC1BadClock
    int auditC1BadData
    int auditC1BadRange
    // V34.11Q: bit 1=TRUE 3C C3 sweep QA (not C2 sweep active C3); 2=2C provisional; 4=expansion rejected;
    // 8=Inside Return QA; 16=Inside Continuation rejected; 32=Multi QA;
    // 64=M15 Retest QA. Diagnostic only, not seven independently
    // certified entry detectors; all use the SAME source M5 context.
    int qaCatalogMask
    // V34.11g additional evidence for the 33 non-BTC H4 blocks.
    // Counts can overlap (one block may violate start and count), so
    // these are NOT mutually exclusive and must not be summed as H4 BAD.
    int qaH4BadStart
    int qaH4BadEnd
    int qaH4BadBars
    int qaH4LastBars
    int qaH4LastStartOffsetMin
    int qaH4LastEndOffsetMin
    int qaLastM5PhaseMin
    int qaSourcePhaseMin
    // V34.11L historical breadcrumbs from this SAME M5 source. These are
    // last observed timestamps, not saved CRT/MSS event certificates.
    int qaLastCandidate2CAt
    int qaLastRatified2CAt
    int qaLastRejectedExpansionAt
    int qaLastConfirmed3CAt
    int qaLastInsideReturnAt
    int qaLastInsideContinuationAt
    int qaLastMulti4At
    int qaLastMultiNAt
    int qaLastRetest15At
    int qaLastCandidate2CCycle
    // Signed last closed C3 H4: +eventAt bullish, -eventAt bearish.
    // Last observed ONLY; not an MSS event or independently certified CRT.
    int qaTrue3CSignedAt
    FamilyVisual familyVisual
    // Independent QA M5 proof of selected Inside/Multi-N ONLY.
    // Multi4 / true3C remain N/V pending own swing evidence.
    float extraFamilyM5Pivot
    int extraFamilyM5PivotAt
    int extraFamilyM5At
    int extraFamilyM5C1

// M3B.2 INTEGRADO (AUTORIZADO): barridas Inside M5 y clasificacion H4 aislada.
// M3B.1: registro pasivo de Inside Bar H4, no genera senales ni entradas.
type InsideCandidate
    string id
    int c1Start
    float c1High
    float c1Low
    float c2High
    float c2Low
    int c2End
    int sweepAt          // Cierre de la primera M5 que observo la barrida
    int sweepH4Start     // H4 que contiene la primera barrida observada
    int sweepDir         // +1: minimo C2, -1: maximo C2; 0: doble
    bool sweptLow        // Conserva barridas ocurridas en distintas M5 de la misma H4
    bool sweptHigh
    string state        // SEEKING/SWEPT/AMBIGUOUS/RATIFIED/CONTINUATION/UNRESOLVED/DATA_GAP
    string modelKind    // Modelo diagnostico: Inside Return/Continuation
    bool isPatternValid // Solo RATIFIED representa retorno estructuralmente valido
    int h4Life          // H4 validas cerradas DESPUES de C2; no horas de reloj.
    // Congelacion causal en la PRIMERA M5 de barrida propia.
    float pivot15
    int pivot15At
    int mss15At
    float pivot5
    int pivot5At
    int mss5At

// Candidato Multi-N por C1/H4 terminal. Maximo 4 (N=2..5).
type MultiNMssCandidate
    int c1Start
    int terminalH4Start
    int direction
    int sweepAt
    float pivot15
    int pivot15At
    int mss15At
    bool doubleSweep
    float pivot5
    int pivot5At
    int mss5At

// 3C TRUE QA: solo esta C1 y esta C3 son dueñas de sus pivotes.
// La observacion solo se publicara si C3 completa ratifica su geometria.
type True3CMssCandidate
    int c1Start
    int c3Start
    float c1High
    float c1Low
    int direction
    int sweepAt
    float pivot5
    int pivot5At
    int mss5At
    float pivot15
    int pivot15At
    int mss15At
    bool doubleSweep

// MULTI4 QA MSS M5/M15: C1 y C2a propios, vigencia hasta C3 (cuarta H4).
type Multi4MssCandidate
    int c1Start
    int c2aStart
    float c1High
    float c1Low
    int direction
    int sweepAt
    float pivot5
    int pivot5At
    int mss5At
    float pivot15
    int pivot15At
    int mss15At
    bool doubleSweep

// M5A INTEGRADO: FVG H4/H1 de contexto, sin salidas ni dibujos.
// Barras TF completas guardadas con tiempo y validez para no cruzar sesiones.
// QA multi-candle: solo OHLC de 4 velas H4 CERRADAS.
// No altera la validacion obligatoria del CRT principal de 3 velas.
type MultiH4
    int startAt
    int endAt
    float hi
    float lo
    float cl
    bool valid

type FvgBar
    int startAt
    int endAt
    float hi
    float lo
    bool valid

type FvgContext
    string id
    string tf
    int dir
    float top
    float bottom
    int formedAt
    string state
    int linkedCrt
    // M5B candidato: seguimiento solo sobre M5 cerradas posteriores a formedAt.
    int firstTouchAt
    float maxPenetration  // Proporcion [0.0, 1.0], no porcentaje sin convertir.
    bool dataGap         // Se interrumpio continuidad observada; estado conservador.
    int lastEvaluatedEnd // Cierre de la ultima M5 procesada; evita duplicados.
    int gapObservedAt    // Primera M5 de discontinuidad no explicada.
    bool lastSessionBar // El cierre ultimo M5 evaluado fue fin de sesion segun proveedor.

// Funciones Pine deben definirse en el ambito global.
f_add_context_fvg(array<FvgContext> store, string tf, int dir, float top, float bottom, int formedAt, bool endSessionOnFormation) =>
    string k = syminfo.tickerid + "|" + tf + "|" + str.tostring(formedAt) + "|" + str.tostring(dir)
    bool exists = false
    if array.size(store) > 0
        for z = 0 to array.size(store) - 1
            if array.get(store, z).id == k
                exists := true
                break
    if not exists
        array.push(store, FvgContext.new(k, tf, dir, top, bottom, formedAt, "INTACTO", na, na, 0.0, false, formedAt, na, endSessionOnFormation))
        if array.size(store) > 10
            array.shift(store)
    not exists

// M5B CANDIDATO NO INTEGRADO: actualizar un FVG con la M5 cerrada.
// Un corte de observabilidad (incluidos cierres de mercado no clasificados)
// congela el estado, NO inventa mitigacion en barras que faltan.
f_update_context_fvg(FvgContext f, int start5, int end5, float lo5, float hi5, float close5, bool firstSession5, bool lastSession5) =>
    bool eligible = not na(start5) and not na(end5) and start5 >= f.formedAt and not na(f.lastEvaluatedEnd) and end5 > f.lastEvaluatedEnd
    if eligible and f.state != "INVALIDADO" and f.state != "DATOS_INCOMPLETOS"
        // Solo el par ultimo-barra-sesion / primer-barra-sesion justifica
        // tratar la pausa como no-trading. NO saltar huecos por dayofweek.
        bool knownClosedSession = start5 > f.lastEvaluatedEnd and f.lastSessionBar and firstSession5
        bool discontinuity = (start5 != f.lastEvaluatedEnd and not knownClosedSession) or end5 - start5 != MIN5 or na(lo5) or na(hi5) or na(close5)
        if discontinuity
            f.dataGap := true
            f.gapObservedAt := start5
            f.state := "DATOS_INCOMPLETOS"
        else
            float width = f.top - f.bottom
            if width > 0.0 and (f.dir == 1 or f.dir == -1)
                bool touched = f.dir == 1 ? lo5 <= f.top : hi5 >= f.bottom
                if touched and na(f.firstTouchAt)
                    f.firstTouchAt := end5
                if touched
                    float rawPen = f.dir == 1 ? (f.top - lo5) / width : (hi5 - f.bottom) / width
                    f.maxPenetration := math.max(f.maxPenetration, math.min(1.0, math.max(0.0, rawPen)))
                bool broken = f.dir == 1 ? close5 < f.bottom : close5 > f.top
                if broken
                    f.state := "INVALIDADO"
                else if f.maxPenetration >= 1.0
                    f.state := "LLENADO_TOTAL"
                else if not na(f.firstTouchAt)
                    // Contacto justo en el borde conserva penetracion 0%.
                    f.state := "PARCIAL"
                else
                    f.state := "INTACTO"
            else
                f.dataGap := true
                f.gapObservedAt := start5
                f.state := "DATOS_INCOMPLETOS"
        f.lastEvaluatedEnd := end5
        f.lastSessionBar := lastSession5
    // Modifica los campos del UDT por referencia; sin reasignar f.
    f.state

// QA: -1=no existe, 0 intacto, 1 parcial, 2 lleno, 3 invalidado, 4 datos incompletos.
f_fvg_code(string st) =>
    st == "INTACTO" ? 0 : st == "PARCIAL" ? 1 : st == "LLENADO_TOTAL" ? 2 : st == "INVALIDADO" ? 3 : st == "DATOS_INCOMPLETOS" ? 4 : -2

// Every M15 candidate must close on this provider's own native phase.
// 0..4 are exact minute offsets, not M5->M15 substitutions.
f_m15_phase_ok(int closedAt, int sourcePhaseMin) =>
    not na(closedAt) and sourcePhaseMin >= 0 and sourcePhaseMin <= 4 and closedAt % MIN15 == sourcePhaseMin * 60000

// En M5 reconstruimos tambien las velas M15 completas, de modo que se usa
// UNA peticion request.security por activo en vez de tres peticiones.
f_engine() =>
    bool isIndex = f_index()
    bool isBTC = str.upper(syminfo.ticker) == "BTCUSD"
    int barT = time[1]
    int barEnd = time_close[1]
    float bH = high[1]
    float bL = low[1]
    float bC = close[1]
    float prevClose = close[2]
    // Datos de sesiones del MISMO ticker M5 dentro del request.security.
    bool firstSession5 = session.isfirstbar[1]
    bool lastSession5 = session.islastbar[1]
    bool previousSessionLast5 = session.islastbar[2]
    int previousBarEnd = time_close[2]
    // QA: la M5 previa debe finalizar exactamente donde inicia la actual.
    // Pine [2] recorre barras, no garantiza ausencia de huecos temporales.
    bool previousM5Continuous = not na(barT) and not na(previousBarEnd) and barT == previousBarEnd

    // La frontera diaria del proveedor se obtiene en el MISMO ticker M5.
    // time("D")[1] identifica la vela diaria a la que pertenece M5[1].
    // Nunca se acepta una sesión cuyo comienzo se perdió en el historial.
    var int currentChartDay = na
    var float currentChartHigh = na
    var float currentChartLow = na
    var bool currentChartContinuous = false
    int chartDayId = time("D")[1]
    if isBTC and not na(barT) and not na(barEnd) and not na(chartDayId)
        if na(currentChartDay) or chartDayId != currentChartDay
            currentChartDay := chartDayId
            currentChartHigh := bH
            currentChartLow := bL
            currentChartContinuous := barT == chartDayId
        else
            currentChartContinuous := currentChartContinuous and previousM5Continuous
            currentChartHigh := math.max(currentChartHigh, bH)
            currentChartLow := math.min(currentChartLow, bL)

    // M4A: PDH/PDL calculados en la misma secuencia M5 cerrada.
    // prev_valid solo significa que la ULTIMA sesion finalizada paso control
    // de calidad; no se reutiliza silenciosamente un nivel de hace dias.
    var float curr_H = na
    var float curr_L = na
    var int curr_sess_id = na
    var int curr_m5_count = 0
    var int curr_firstT = na
    var int curr_lastEnd = na
    var bool curr_continuous = true
    var float prev_PDH = na
    var float prev_PDL = na
    var bool prev_valid = false
    var int prev_timestamp = na
    var int prev_sess_id = na
    // M4B: el ID del nivel es su fecha de confirmacion 4A.
    // No se consulta curr_sess_id[1] ni se reevalua una vela incompleta.
    var int liquidityRefAt = na
    var bool pdhTaken = false
    var bool pdlTaken = false
    var int pdhSweepAt = na
    var int pdlSweepAt = na
    var int pdhSweepStage = 0
    var int pdlSweepStage = 0
    var int pdhSweepC1 = na
    var int pdlSweepC1 = na

    // BTCUSD no hereda sesiones de Forex: PDH/PDL del dia civil NY
    // completo (00:00-00:00), 7 dias. Cierre M5 [1] confirmado.
    // En DST NY el dia completo tiene 23, 24 o 25 horas.
    bool pdhRth = isIndex and not useExtIdx
    string pdhSession = isBTC ? "0000-0000:1234567" : pdhRth ? "0930-1600:23456" : "1700-1700:23456"
    bool pdhInSession = not na(time("5", pdhSession, TZ)[1])
    if isBTC
        if pdhInSession and not na(barT) and not na(barEnd) and not na(bH) and not na(bL)
            int startNY = timestamp(TZ, year(barT, TZ), month(barT, TZ), dayofmonth(barT, TZ), 0, 0)
            int endNY = timestamp(TZ, year(barEnd, TZ), month(barEnd, TZ), dayofmonth(barEnd, TZ), 0, 0)
            int dayKey = year(barT, TZ) * 10000 + month(barT, TZ) * 100 + dayofmonth(barT, TZ)
            // Si faltó un día completo de mercado, no comparar contra
            // un PDH viejo (debe ser EXACTAMENTE el día NY anterior).
            if prev_valid and not na(prev_timestamp)
                int refDayKey = year(prev_timestamp, TZ) * 10000 + month(prev_timestamp, TZ) * 100 + dayofmonth(prev_timestamp, TZ)
                if refDayKey != dayKey
                    prev_valid := false
            if na(curr_sess_id) or curr_sess_id != dayKey
                if not na(curr_sess_id)
                    prev_valid := false
                curr_sess_id := dayKey
                curr_H := bH
                curr_L := bL
                curr_m5_count := 1
                curr_firstT := barT
                curr_lastEnd := barEnd
                curr_continuous := true
            else
                curr_continuous := curr_continuous and barT == curr_lastEnd
                curr_H := math.max(curr_H, bH)
                curr_L := math.min(curr_L, bL)
                curr_m5_count += 1
                curr_lastEnd := barEnd
            bool closedNYDay = endNY > startNY and barEnd == endNY
            if closedNYDay
                int expectedM5 = int((endNY - startNY) / MIN5)
                bool fullNYDay = curr_continuous and curr_firstT == startNY and curr_lastEnd == endNY and curr_m5_count == expectedM5 and (expectedM5 == 276 or expectedM5 == 288 or expectedM5 == 300)
                prev_valid := fullNYDay
                if fullNYDay
                    prev_PDH := curr_H
                    prev_PDL := curr_L
                    prev_timestamp := endNY
                    prev_sess_id := curr_sess_id
                curr_sess_id := na
                curr_H := na
                curr_L := na
                curr_m5_count := 0
                curr_firstT := na
                curr_lastEnd := na
                curr_continuous := true
    else
        // Sesiones originales de Forex e indices: no alterarlas.
        if not na(barT) and not na(barEnd) and not na(bH) and not na(bL)
            // Identidad calendario local del INICIO de sesion; segura en DST.
            // Mediodia menos 24h identifica el DIA ANTERIOR incluso si DST
            // cambio el desfase UTC una hora durante la madrugada.
            int pdhNoon = timestamp(TZ, year(barT, TZ), month(barT, TZ), dayofmonth(barT, TZ), 12, 0)
            int pdhAnchor = pdhRth or hour(barT, TZ) >= 17 ? pdhNoon : pdhNoon - 86400000
            int pdhKey = year(pdhAnchor, TZ) * 10000 + month(pdhAnchor, TZ) * 100 + dayofmonth(pdhAnchor, TZ)
            if pdhInSession
                if na(curr_sess_id) or pdhKey != curr_sess_id
                    // Si un dia termino sin vela de cierre, NO publicar parcial.
                    if not na(curr_sess_id)
                        prev_valid := false
                    curr_sess_id := pdhKey
                    curr_H := bH
                    curr_L := bL
                    curr_m5_count := 1
                    curr_firstT := barT
                    curr_lastEnd := barEnd
                    curr_continuous := true
                else
                    curr_continuous := curr_continuous and barT == curr_lastEnd
                    curr_H := math.max(curr_H, bH)
                    curr_L := math.min(curr_L, bL)
                    curr_m5_count += 1
                    curr_lastEnd := barEnd
                // Con la ultima M5 (15:55-16 o 16:55-17) se cierra
                // la sesion, aunque el proveedor no tenga velas posteriores.
                int endHour = pdhRth ? 16 : 17
                bool sessClosed = hour(barEnd, TZ) == endHour and minute(barEnd, TZ) == 0
                if sessClosed
                    int firstHour = pdhRth ? 9 : 17
                    int firstMinute = minute(curr_firstT, TZ)
                    bool startedOnTime = hour(curr_firstT, TZ) == firstHour and (pdhRth ? firstMinute == 30 : firstMinute <= 5)
                    bool complete = curr_continuous and startedOnTime and curr_m5_count >= (pdhRth ? 78 : 280)
                    prev_valid := complete
                    if complete
                        prev_PDH := curr_H
                        prev_PDL := curr_L
                        prev_timestamp := barEnd
                        prev_sess_id := curr_sess_id
                    // Valores historicos se conservan con prev_valid=false.
                    curr_sess_id := na
                    curr_H := na
                    curr_L := na
                    curr_m5_count := 0
                    curr_firstT := na
                    curr_lastEnd := na
                    curr_continuous := true
            else if not na(curr_sess_id)
                // Fin de sesion sin M5 de cierre: no falsificar PDH/PDL.
                prev_valid := false
                curr_sess_id := na
                curr_m5_count := 0
                curr_H := na
                curr_L := na
                curr_firstT := na
                curr_lastEnd := na
                curr_continuous := true
    // Pivot M5: calculo en la barra cerrada [1]; nunca es una barra futura.
    float pH5 = ta.pivothigh(high, left5, right5)[1]
    float pL5 = ta.pivotlow(low, left5, right5)[1]
    var float lastHigh5 = na
    var float lastLow5 = na
    var int lastHigh5At = na
    var int lastLow5At = na
    // M5 continuity barrier for auxiliary-family frozen pivots.
    var int qaExtraM5SegmentStart = na

    // Acumulador M15 sobre barras M5 completas.
    var int m15Bucket = na
    var float m15High = na
    var float m15Low = na
    var float m15Close = na
    var int m15Count = 0
    var int m15LastEnd = na
    var int m15Start = na
    var array<float> highs15 = array.new_float()
    var array<float> lows15 = array.new_float()
    var array<int> times15 = array.new_int()
    var float lastHigh15 = na
    var float lastLow15 = na
    var int lastHigh15At = na
    var int lastLow15At = na
    var float prev15Close = na
    // QA: solo comparar cierres M15 consecutivos completos (no saltar sesiones).
    var int prev15End = na
    var int lastCompleteM15CloseAt = na

    // H4 reconstruida desde datos de M5 del mismo proveedor.
    var int h4Bucket = na
    var float h4High = na
    var float h4Low = na
    var float h4Close = na
    var int h4Count = 0
    var int h4FirstT = na
    var int h4LastEnd = na
    // Modulo 1 aprobado: rechaza H4 con huecos M5 internos.
    var bool h4Continuous = true

    // M5A: Reconstruccion H1 desde M5 cerradas y memoria de 3 barras TF.
    var int h1Bucket = na
    var int h1FirstT = na
    var int h1LastEnd = na
    var float h1High = na
    var float h1Low = na
    var int h1Count = 0
    var bool h1Continuous = true
    var FvgBar h1Prev = na
    var FvgBar h1Prev2 = na
    var FvgBar h4Prev = na
    var FvgBar h4Prev2 = na
    // Maximo cuatro H4 completas en el mismo feed, memoria O(4).
    var array<MultiH4> qaFourH4 = array.new<MultiH4>()
    var string qaMulti4Kind = "SIN 4H4"
    var int qaMulti4At = na
    var int qaMulti4C1 = na
    var array<Multi4MssCandidate> qaMulti4MssCandidates = array.new<Multi4MssCandidate>()
    var int qaMulti4SweepAt = na
    var float qaMulti4Pivot5 = na
    var int qaMulti4Pivot5At = na
    var int qaMulti4Mss5At = na
    var float qaMulti4Pivot15 = na
    var int qaMulti4Pivot15At = na
    var int qaMulti4Mss15At = na
    // QA Multi-N: C1 + 2..5 H4 de consolidacion estricta + H4
    // final que barre un solo extremo y cierra DENTRO de la C1.
    // HIPOTESIS DEEPSEEK, independiente del MULTI4 distribuido.
    // Hasta 7 H4 cerradas del mismo proveedor (O(7) por símbolo).
    var array<MultiH4> qaMultiNHistory = array.new<MultiH4>()
    var string qaMultiNKind = "MULTI-N ESP"
    var int qaMultiNAt = na
    var int qaMultiNC1 = na
    var int qaMultiNDir = 0
    var array<MultiNMssCandidate> qaMultiNMssCandidates = array.new<MultiNMssCandidate>()
    var int qaMultiNSweepAt = na
    var float qaMultiNPivot15 = na
    var int qaMultiNPivot15At = na
    var int qaMultiNMss15At = na
    var float qaMultiNPivot5 = na
    var int qaMultiNPivot5At = na
    var int qaMultiNMss5At = na
    // Retest: cierre M15 propio POSTERIOR al MSS15 del mismo C1.
    var string qaRetest15State = "SIN MSS15"
    var int qaRetest15At = na
    // OHLC cerrado de LA vela M15 del retest; no del último M15 visible.
    var float qaRetest15High = na
    var float qaRetest15Low = na
    var float qaRetest15Close = na
    var float qaRetest15Pivot = na
    var int qaRetestCycleC1 = na
    var int qaRetestSourceMssAt = na
    var array<FvgContext> fvgsH1 = array.new<FvgContext>()
    var array<FvgContext> fvgsH4 = array.new<FvgContext>()

    // C2 actual: puede coexistir con la C3 del CRT anterior.
    // M3B.1: memoria independiente por contexto de simbolo (maximo 10).
    var array<InsideCandidate> insideCandidates = array.new<InsideCandidate>()

    var bool c2Active = false
    var int c2Start = na
    var int c1Start2 = na
    var float c1High2 = na
    var float c1Low2 = na
    var int c2Dir = 0
    var bool c2StrictSweep = false
    var bool c2Double = false
    var bool c2Returned = false
    var int c2SweepEnd = na
    var float c2Pivot5 = na
    var float c2Pivot15 = na
    var int c2Pivot5At = na
    var int c2Pivot15At = na
    var int c2M5At = na
    var int c2M15At = na

    // C3 ratificada: los MSS de C2 se heredan, los faltantes se esperan en C3.
    var bool c3Active = false
    var int c3Start = na
    var int c1Start3 = na
    var float c1High3 = na
    var float c1Low3 = na
    var int c3Dir = 0
    var int c3SweepEnd = na
    var float c3Pivot5 = na
    var float c3Pivot15 = na
    var int c3Pivot5At = na
    var int c3Pivot15At = na
    var int c3M5At = na
    var int c3M15At = na
    var float c3Invalidation = na
    // Metadatos del CRT ratificado que se encuentra en C3.
    var string c3ModelKind = "NONE"
    var bool c3PatternValid = false
    var int c3ModelC1 = na
    var int c3C2Start = na // Solo metadato para asociar PDH/PDL, sin alterar MSS.

    // Clasificacion diagnostica del ultimo cierre C2, aun si no es operativo.
    var string last2CClassification = "NONE"
    var int last2CClassificationAt = na

    // Memoria controlada del ULTIMO CRT realmente ratificado, NO de
    // cualquier MSS aislado. Los flags se copian desde C2/C3 y no se
    // inventan desde eventos antiguos no vinculados al ciclo.
    var int lastC1 = na
    var int lastDir = 0
    var int lastConfirmedAt = na
    var float lastHi = na
    var float lastLo = na
    var int lastSweepAt = na
    var int lastM5 = na
    var int lastM15 = na
    var float lastM5Level = na
    var float lastM15Level = na
    var int lastM5PivotAt = na
    var int lastM15PivotAt = na
    var string lastModelKind = "NONE"
    var bool lastPatternValid = false
    var int lastModelC1 = na
    var int lastC2Start = na // Memoria del mismo CRT ratificado.
    // Conteos solo del historial M5 efectivamente cargado. No
    // certifican que existan alertas ni muestran CRT antiguos.
    var int qaC1Ready = 0
    var int qaC2Ratified = 0
    var string qaLastC2Gate = "ESPERA C1"
    // Auditoria acumulada en M5 cargadas; cada contador cambia SOLO
    // en un cierre H4 o transicion terminal de candidato Inside.
    var int qaAudit2C = 0
    var int qaAudit3C = 0
    var int qaAuditInside = 0
    var int qaAuditM4 = 0
    var int qaAuditMN = 0
    var int qaAuditC2Data = 0
    var int qaAuditC2Double = 0
    var int qaAuditC2NoSweep = 0
    var int qaAuditC2Outside = 0
    var int qaAuditC2Hour = 0
    var int qaAuditC3Invalid = 0
    var int qaAuditInsideData = 0
    var int qaAuditInsideDouble = 0
    var int qaAuditInsideOther = 0
    var int qaAuditInsideExpire = 0
    var int qaAuditMNNoTerminal = 0
    var int qaAuditMNDouble = 0
    var int qaAuditMNOutside = 0
    // V34.11L historical markers, updated on CLOSED M5/H4 transitions.
    var int qaLastCandidate2CAt = na
    var int qaLastCandidate2CCycle = na
    var int qaTrue3CSignedAt = na
    var True3CMssCandidate qaTrue3CPending = na
    var True3CMssCandidate qaTrue3CConfirmed = na
    var int qaLastRatified2CAt = na
    var int qaLastRejectedExpansionAt = na
    var int qaLastConfirmed3CAt = na
    var int qaLastInsideReturnAt = na
    var int qaLastInsideContinuationAt = na
    var int qaLastMulti4At = na
    var int qaLastMultiNAt = na
    var int qaLastRetest15At = na
    var int qaAuditH4Incomplete = 0
    // Una H4 no-48 NO implica siempre feed defectuoso. Disjuntas:
    // DST NY, sesion/parcial, discontinuidad M5 INTERNA.
    var int qaAuditH4DST = 0
    var int qaAuditH4Session = 0
    var int qaAuditH4Internal = 0
    var int qaAuditC1H4Closed = 0
    var int qaAuditC1HourCandidates = 0
    var int qaAuditC1BadClock = 0
    var int qaAuditC1BadData = 0
    var int qaAuditC1BadRange = 0
    // H4 evidence: these count violated boundary/count predicates, not
    // necessarily broken market data. Any one H4 may fail several.
    var int qaH4BadStart = 0
    var int qaH4BadEnd = 0
    var int qaH4BadBars = 0
    var int qaH4LastBars = na
    var int qaH4LastStartOffsetMin = na
    var int qaH4LastEndOffsetMin = na

    // Procesamos la ULTIMA M5 cerrada, no la M5 en formacion.
    // f_engine() debe evaluarse incondicionalmente en cada barra M5.
    // V34.11j: measure each 33 feed independently on its LAST CLOSED M5.
    // A phase +2 on metals cannot be normalized to +1 from NZDCAD.
    // Reject nonzero seconds; BTC clock and model remain untouched.
    int qaLastM5PhaseMin = not na(barT) ? minute(barT, TZ) % 5 : na
    int qaNativeSourcePhaseMin = qaPhase1NonBtc and not isBTC and not na(barT) and second(barT, TZ) == 0 ? qaLastM5PhaseMin : 0
    // A native +p M15 is :p/:15+p/:30+p/:45+p; H1 is at hh:p.
    // Native-source QA is NOT a validated NY :00 entry setup.
    int bucketH1 = qaNativeSourcePhaseMin > 0 ? timestamp(TZ, year(barT, TZ), month(barT, TZ), dayofmonth(barT, TZ), hour(barT, TZ), qaNativeSourcePhaseMin, 0) : time("60")[1]
    int nativeM15Minute = int(math.floor(minute(barT, TZ) / 15)) * 15 + qaNativeSourcePhaseMin
    int bucket15 = qaNativeSourcePhaseMin > 0 ? timestamp(TZ, year(barT, TZ), month(barT, TZ), dayofmonth(barT, TZ), hour(barT, TZ), nativeM15Minute, 0) : time("15")[1]
    int bucketH4NY = isBTC ? f_btc_crt_h4_ny(barT) : isIndex ? f_index_crt_h4_ny(barT) : f_forex_metal_crt_h4_ny(barT)
    int bucketH4 = bucketH4NY + qaNativeSourcePhaseMin * 60000

    // QA: al aparecer una nueva M5 despues de un hueco, descartar
    // acumuladores y swings M15 de la cadena anterior. No permitir que
    // pivotes confirmados con barras discontinuas crucen a un nuevo CRT.
    // Explicitly initialize on the first usable CLOSED M5 bar.
    // On subsequent disconnections, a stale pre-gap pivot is forbidden.
    // Pine v6 bool never na; this guard documents first-segment intent.
    if (na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) or not previousM5Continuous) and not na(barT)
        qaExtraM5SegmentStart := barT
        lastCompleteM15CloseAt := na
        m15Bucket := na
        m15Count := 0
        m15LastEnd := na
        m15Start := na
        prev15Close := na
        prev15End := na
        array.clear(highs15)
        array.clear(lows15)
        array.clear(times15)
        lastHigh15 := na
        lastLow15 := na
        lastHigh15At := na
        lastLow15At := na
        // Un hueco M5 invalida los pivotes/MSS auxiliares pendientes.
        array.clear(qaMultiNMssCandidates)
        qaMultiNMss15At := na
        qaMultiNMss5At := na
        qaMultiNPivot5 := na
        qaMultiNPivot5At := na
        qaMultiNPivot15 := na
        qaMultiNPivot15At := na
        qaMultiNSweepAt := na
        // La barrida 3C nunca puede cruzar una discontinuidad M5.
        qaTrue3CPending := na
        array.clear(qaMulti4MssCandidates)
        if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
            for z = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                InsideCandidate stale = array.get(insideCandidates, z)
                stale.mss15At := na
                stale.pivot15 := na
                stale.pivot15At := na
                stale.mss5At := na
                stale.pivot5 := na
                stale.pivot5At := na

    // ---- CERRAR M15 ANTERIOR ----
    if not na(barT) and not na(bucket15)
        bool next15 = not na(m15Bucket) and bucket15 != m15Bucket
        if next15
            bool fullM15 = m15Count == 3 and m15LastEnd == bucket15 and m15Start + MIN15 == m15LastEnd
            if fullM15
                // Solo tras TRES M5 consecutivas: la M15 esta cerrada.
                // Un MSS M5 previo nunca actualiza este timestamp.
                lastCompleteM15CloseAt := m15LastEnd
                array.push(highs15, m15High)
                array.push(lows15, m15Low)
                array.push(times15, m15Start)
                if array.size(highs15) > 48
                    array.shift(highs15)
                    array.shift(lows15)
                    array.shift(times15)
                int n = array.size(highs15)
                int pivot = n - 1 - right15
                if pivot >= left15 and pivot >= 0
                    float candH = array.get(highs15, pivot)
                    float candL = array.get(lows15, pivot)
                    bool okHi = true
                    bool okLo = true
                    for j = -left15 to right15
                        if j != 0
                            okHi := okHi and candH > array.get(highs15, pivot + j)
                            okLo := okLo and candL < array.get(lows15, pivot + j)
                    if okHi
                        lastHigh15 := candH
                        lastHigh15At := array.get(times15, pivot)
                    if okLo
                        lastLow15 := candL
                        lastLow15At := array.get(times15, pivot)

                // QA: MSS M15 requiere cierre anterior INMEDIATO y completo.
                // Tras huecos, inicios de feed o pausas no se inventa cross.
                bool prev15Continuous = not na(prev15End) and prev15End == m15Start and not na(prev15Close)
                // Comprobar rompimientos M15 correspondientes al MISMO CRT.
                // Se ejecuta ANTES del cierre H4: incluye el ultimo M15 de C2.
                int closed15At = m15LastEnd
                if c2Active and c2Dir != 0 and c2StrictSweep and not c2Double and not na(c2SweepEnd) and closed15At > c2SweepEnd
                    // El pivote debe ser M15 confirmado y ANTERIOR
                    // a la barrida C2; ruptura por CIERRE de M15, no M5.
                    bool frozenPivot15 = not na(c2Pivot15) and not na(c2Pivot15At) and c2Pivot15At < c2SweepEnd
                    bool exact15Close = closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                    bool eligible15 = exact15Close and frozenPivot15 and prev15Continuous and (c2Dir == 1 ? (m15Close > c2Pivot15 and prev15Close <= c2Pivot15) : (m15Close < c2Pivot15 and prev15Close >= c2Pivot15))
                    if eligible15 and na(c2M15At)
                        c2M15At := closed15At
                if c3Active and not na(c3SweepEnd) and closed15At > c3Start and closed15At > c3SweepEnd
                    bool frozenPivot15 = not na(c3Pivot15) and not na(c3Pivot15At) and c3Pivot15At < c3SweepEnd
                    bool exact15Close = closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                    bool eligible15 = exact15Close and frozenPivot15 and prev15Continuous and (c3Dir == 1 ? (m15Close > c3Pivot15 and prev15Close <= c3Pivot15) : (m15Close < c3Pivot15 and prev15Close >= c3Pivot15))
                    if eligible15 and na(c3M15At)
                        c3M15At := closed15At
                        if lastC1 == c1Start3
                            lastM15 := closed15At
                // MSS M15 independientes: solo CIERRE real de 3 M5 del mismo feed.
                // Al ratificar H4 podremos publicar la prueba propia, no antes.
                if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
                    for ix = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                        InsideCandidate q = array.get(insideCandidates, ix)
                        bool eligibleInsideM15 = (q.state == "SWEPT" or q.state == "RATIFIED") and q.sweepDir != 0 and q.sweptLow != q.sweptHigh and not na(q.sweepAt) and not na(q.pivot15) and not na(q.pivot15At) and q.pivot15At < q.sweepAt and closed15At > q.sweepAt and closed15At <= q.sweepH4Start + 2 * H4MS and na(q.mss15At) and prev15Continuous and closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                        bool crossedInside = q.sweepDir == 1 ? m15Close > q.pivot15 and prev15Close <= q.pivot15 : m15Close < q.pivot15 and prev15Close >= q.pivot15
                        if eligibleInsideM15 and crossedInside
                            q.mss15At := closed15At
                // Multi4 M15 es independiente del M5 y de 2C/Inside/Multi-N.
                // Solo pivot L2/R2 confirmado ANTES de la primera barrida C2a.
                // Se cuenta cierre M15 de 3 M5 completas, continuo y posterior
                // a sweep; el cuarto H4 (C3) es el limite causal superior.
                if array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) > 0
                    for q4i = 0 to array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) - 1
                        Multi4MssCandidate q4 = array.get(qaMulti4MssCandidates, q4i)
                        bool eligible4M15 = not q4.doubleSweep and q4.direction != 0 and not na(q4.sweepAt) and q4.sweepAt > q4.c2aStart and q4.sweepAt <= q4.c2aStart + H4MS and not na(q4.pivot15) and not na(q4.pivot15At) and q4.pivot15At < q4.sweepAt and na(q4.mss15At) and closed15At > q4.sweepAt and closed15At <= q4.c2aStart + 3 * H4MS and prev15Continuous and closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                        bool crossed4M15 = q4.direction == 1 ? m15Close > q4.pivot15 and prev15Close <= q4.pivot15 : q4.direction == -1 ? m15Close < q4.pivot15 and prev15Close >= q4.pivot15 : false
                        if eligible4M15 and crossed4M15
                            q4.mss15At := closed15At
                if array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) > 0
                    for mi = 0 to array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) - 1
                        MultiNMssCandidate q = array.get(qaMultiNMssCandidates, mi)
                        bool eligibleMultiM15 = not q.doubleSweep and q.direction != 0 and not na(q.pivot15) and not na(q.pivot15At) and not na(q.sweepAt) and q.pivot15At < q.sweepAt and na(q.mss15At) and closed15At > q.sweepAt and closed15At <= q.terminalH4Start + H4MS and prev15Continuous and closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                        bool crossedMulti = q.direction == 1 ? m15Close > q.pivot15 and prev15Close <= q.pivot15 : m15Close < q.pivot15 and prev15Close >= q.pivot15
                        if eligibleMultiM15 and crossedMulti
                            q.mss15At := closed15At
                // Extender Multi-N ya ratificado hasta max. una H4 adicional.
                bool eligibleRatifiedMulti = not na(qaMultiNAt) and not na(qaMultiNSweepAt) and not na(qaMultiNPivot15At) and not na(qaMultiNPivot15) and qaMultiNPivot15At < qaMultiNSweepAt and na(qaMultiNMss15At) and closed15At > qaMultiNSweepAt and closed15At <= qaMultiNAt + H4MS and closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin) and prev15Continuous
                bool crossedRatifiedMulti = qaMultiNDir == 1 ? m15Close > qaMultiNPivot15 and prev15Close <= qaMultiNPivot15 : qaMultiNDir == -1 ? m15Close < qaMultiNPivot15 and prev15Close >= qaMultiNPivot15 : false
                if eligibleRatifiedMulti and crossedRatifiedMulti
                    qaMultiNMss15At := closed15At
                // 3C TRUE: pivote M15 PRE-barrida propio, cierre de TRES
                // M5 del proveedor, nunca una confirmacion prestada del 2C.
                if not na(qaTrue3CPending)
                    True3CMssCandidate q3 = qaTrue3CPending
                    bool eligible3M15 = q3.direction != 0 and not q3.doubleSweep and not na(q3.sweepAt) and not na(q3.pivot15) and not na(q3.pivot15At) and q3.pivot15At < q3.sweepAt and na(q3.mss15At) and closed15At > q3.sweepAt and closed15At <= q3.c3Start + H4MS and prev15Continuous and closed15At == bucket15 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                    bool crossed3M15 = q3.direction == 1 ? m15Close > q3.pivot15 and prev15Close <= q3.pivot15 : q3.direction == -1 ? m15Close < q3.pivot15 and prev15Close >= q3.pivot15 : false
                    if eligible3M15 and crossed3M15
                        q3.mss15At := closed15At
                // QA RETEST M15: nunca disparar en la misma barra MSS,
                // ni por una M5, ni reusar el pivote de un CRT distinto.
                int qaCycle = c3Active ? c1Start3 : c2Active ? c1Start2 : na
                int qaMssAt = c3Active ? c3M15At : c2Active ? c2M15At : na
                int qaDir = c3Active ? c3Dir : c2Active ? c2Dir : 0
                float qaLevel = c3Active ? c3Pivot15 : c2Active ? c2Pivot15 : na
                if na(qaCycle) or na(qaMssAt) or na(qaLevel)
                    qaRetest15State := "SIN MSS15"
                    qaRetest15At := na
                    qaRetest15High := na
                    qaRetest15Low := na
                    qaRetest15Close := na
                    qaRetest15Pivot := na
                    qaRetestCycleC1 := na
                    qaRetestSourceMssAt := na
                else
                    bool freshQaRetest = na(qaRetestCycleC1) or qaRetestCycleC1 != qaCycle or na(qaRetestSourceMssAt) or qaRetestSourceMssAt != qaMssAt
                    if freshQaRetest
                        qaRetestCycleC1 := qaCycle
                        qaRetestSourceMssAt := qaMssAt
                        qaRetest15At := na
                        qaRetest15High := na
                        qaRetest15Low := na
                        qaRetest15Close := na
                        qaRetest15Pivot := na
                        qaRetest15State := "ESPERA RETEST"
                    bool postMss15 = closed15At > qaMssAt and closed15At <= qaMssAt + 4 * 3600000 and f_m15_phase_ok(closed15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin)
                    bool touchedRetest = qaDir == 1 ? m15Low <= qaLevel and m15Close > qaLevel : qaDir == -1 ? m15High >= qaLevel and m15Close < qaLevel : false
                    if na(qaRetest15At) and postMss15 and prev15Continuous and touchedRetest
                        qaRetest15At := closed15At
                        qaRetest15High := m15High
                        qaRetest15Low := m15Low
                        qaRetest15Close := m15Close
                        qaRetest15Pivot := qaLevel
                        qaRetest15State := "RETEST M15 QA"
                prev15Close := m15Close
                prev15End := m15LastEnd
            else
                lastCompleteM15CloseAt := na
                // Una M15 omitida o incompleta invalida pivotes construidos
                // con muestras discontinuas, y el cierre previo del MSS.
                prev15Close := na
                prev15End := na
                array.clear(highs15)
                array.clear(lows15)
                array.clear(times15)
                lastHigh15 := na
                lastLow15 := na
                lastHigh15At := na
                lastLow15At := na

            m15Bucket := bucket15
            m15High := bH
            m15Low := bL
            m15Close := bC
            m15Count := 1
            m15LastEnd := barEnd
            m15Start := bucket15
        else if na(m15Bucket)
            m15Bucket := bucket15
            m15High := bH
            m15Low := bL
            m15Close := bC
            m15Count := 1
            m15LastEnd := barEnd
            m15Start := bucket15
        else
            if barT != m15LastEnd
                m15Count := -100 // M15 incompleta: no publicar MSS.
                // No conservar swings ni el cierre de un M15 sin continuidad.
                prev15Close := na
                prev15End := na
                array.clear(highs15)
                array.clear(lows15)
                array.clear(times15)
                lastHigh15 := na
                lastLow15 := na
                lastHigh15At := na
                lastLow15At := na
            else if m15Count >= 0
                m15Count += 1
            m15High := math.max(m15High, bH)
            m15Low := math.min(m15Low, bL)
            m15Close := bC
            m15LastEnd := barEnd

    // ---- M5A: CIERRE H1, FVG SIN LOOKAHEAD ----
    if not na(barT) and not na(bucketH1)
        bool nextH1 = not na(h1Bucket) and bucketH1 != h1Bucket
        if nextH1
            bool fullH1 = h1Continuous and h1Count == 12 and h1FirstT == h1Bucket and h1LastEnd == h1Bucket + 3600000
            if fullH1 and not na(h1Prev) and not na(h1Prev2)
                bool chainH1 = h1Prev.valid and h1Prev2.valid and h1Prev2.endAt == h1Prev.startAt and h1Prev.endAt == h1Bucket
                if chainH1
                    if h1Low > h1Prev2.hi
                        f_add_context_fvg(fvgsH1, "H1", 1, h1Low, h1Prev2.hi, h1LastEnd, previousBarEnd == h1LastEnd and previousSessionLast5)
                    else if h1High < h1Prev2.lo
                        f_add_context_fvg(fvgsH1, "H1", -1, h1Prev2.lo, h1High, h1LastEnd, previousBarEnd == h1LastEnd and previousSessionLast5)
            h1Prev2 := h1Prev
            h1Prev := FvgBar.new(h1Bucket, h1LastEnd, h1High, h1Low, fullH1)
            h1Bucket := bucketH1
            h1FirstT := barT
            h1LastEnd := barEnd
            h1High := bH
            h1Low := bL
            h1Count := 1
            h1Continuous := true
        else if na(h1Bucket)
            h1Bucket := bucketH1
            h1FirstT := barT
            h1LastEnd := barEnd
            h1High := bH
            h1Low := bL
            h1Count := 1
            h1Continuous := true
        else
            h1Continuous := h1Continuous and barT == h1LastEnd
            h1High := math.max(h1High, bH)
            h1Low := math.min(h1Low, bL)
            h1Count += 1
            h1LastEnd := barEnd

    // ---- CERRAR H4 ANTERIOR Y ABRIR NUEVA ----
    if not na(barT) and not na(bucketH4)
        bool nextH4 = not na(h4Bucket) and bucketH4 != h4Bucket
        if nextH4
            // QA: registrar cuántos bloques H4 del mismo feed se han
            // observado; no confundir respuesta de request.security con
            // presencia de C1 válida ni inventar formaciones CRT.
            qaAuditC1H4Closed += 1
            // Last H4 timestamp/candle evidence before opening the next.
            // Time deltas are based on the same M5 feed, not chart M15/H4.
            qaH4LastBars := h4Count
            qaH4LastStartOffsetMin := na(h4FirstT) ? na : int((h4FirstT - h4Bucket) / 60000)
            qaH4LastEndOffsetMin := na(h4LastEnd) ? na : int((h4LastEnd - (h4Bucket + H4MS)) / 60000)
            if h4FirstT != h4Bucket
                qaH4BadStart += 1
            if h4LastEnd != h4Bucket + H4MS
                qaH4BadEnd += 1
            if h4Count != 48
                qaH4BadBars += 1
            // M5A: Tres H4 completas consecutivas, sin conectar gaps de mercado.
            bool fullH4 = h4Continuous and h4Count == 48 and h4FirstT == h4Bucket and h4LastEnd == h4Bucket + H4MS
            if not fullH4
                qaAuditH4Incomplete += 1
                int spanH4Ms = bucketH4 - h4Bucket
                bool exactDSTBlock = (spanH4Ms == H4MS + 3600000 or spanH4Ms == H4MS - 3600000) and h4Continuous and h4FirstT == h4Bucket and h4LastEnd == bucketH4 and h4Count * 300000 == spanH4Ms
                if exactDSTBlock
                    // Completa en horario local NY, duración real 3/5h.
                    qaAuditH4DST += 1
                else if not h4Continuous
                    // Hueco dentro de un bloque que sí tenía M5.
                    qaAuditH4Internal += 1
                else
                    // Inicio/fin incompleto (historial o horario de
                    // mercado); no atribuir a pérdida del proveedor.
                    qaAuditH4Session += 1
            if fullH4 and not na(h4Prev) and not na(h4Prev2)
                bool chainH4 = h4Prev.valid and h4Prev2.valid and h4Prev2.endAt == h4Prev.startAt and h4Prev.endAt == h4Bucket
                if chainH4
                    if h4Low > h4Prev2.hi
                        f_add_context_fvg(fvgsH4, "H4", 1, h4Low, h4Prev2.hi, h4LastEnd, previousBarEnd == h4LastEnd and previousSessionLast5)
                    else if h4High < h4Prev2.lo
                        f_add_context_fvg(fvgsH4, "H4", -1, h4Prev2.lo, h4High, h4LastEnd, previousBarEnd == h4LastEnd and previousSessionLast5)
            h4Prev2 := h4Prev
            h4Prev := FvgBar.new(h4Bucket, h4LastEnd, h4High, h4Low, fullH4)
            // QA MULTI4: barrida y retorno se distribuyen en DOS H4
            // consecutivas, luego una tercera H4 de distribucion.
            // Es una familia experimental, NO sustituye la C2 unica del
            // modelo soberano C1/C2/C3 y NUNCA produce un MSS confirmado.
            if not fullH4
                array.clear(qaFourH4)
                qaMulti4Kind := "H4 INCOMPLETA"
                qaMulti4At := na
                qaMulti4C1 := na
                qaMulti4SweepAt := na
                qaMulti4Pivot5 := na
                qaMulti4Pivot5At := na
                qaMulti4Mss5At := na
                qaMulti4Pivot15 := na
                qaMulti4Pivot15At := na
                qaMulti4Mss15At := na
                array.clear(qaMulti4MssCandidates)
            else
                array.push(qaFourH4, MultiH4.new(h4Bucket, h4LastEnd, h4High, h4Low, h4Close, true))
                if array.size(qaFourH4) > 4
                    array.shift(qaFourH4)
                if array.size(qaFourH4) == 4
                    MultiH4 m1 = array.get(qaFourH4, 0)
                    MultiH4 m2 = array.get(qaFourH4, 1)
                    MultiH4 m3 = array.get(qaFourH4, 2)
                    MultiH4 m4 = array.get(qaFourH4, 3)
                    bool fourConsecutive = m1.endAt == m2.startAt and m2.endAt == m3.startAt and m3.endAt == m4.startAt
                    bool allowedC1 = f_allowed(hour(m1.startAt, TZ), isIndex)
                    bool sweptLow4 = m2.lo < m1.lo and m2.hi <= m1.hi and m3.hi <= m1.hi
                    bool sweptHigh4 = m2.hi > m1.hi and m2.lo >= m1.lo and m3.lo >= m1.lo
                    bool c2aReturn = m2.cl >= m1.lo and m2.cl <= m1.hi
                    bool c2bReturn = m3.cl >= m1.lo and m3.cl <= m1.hi
                    bool multiBull = sweptLow4 and c2aReturn and c2bReturn and m3.lo <= m1.lo and m4.cl > m3.cl and m4.cl >= m1.lo
                    bool multiBear = sweptHigh4 and c2aReturn and c2bReturn and m3.hi >= m1.hi and m4.cl < m3.cl and m4.cl <= m1.hi
                    if fourConsecutive and allowedC1 and (multiBull != multiBear)
                        qaAuditM4 += 1
                        qaLastMulti4At := m4.endAt
                        qaMulti4Kind := multiBull ? "MULTI4 BULL QA" : "MULTI4 BEAR QA"
                        qaMulti4At := m4.endAt
                        qaMulti4C1 := m1.startAt
                        qaMulti4SweepAt := na
                        qaMulti4Pivot5 := na
                        qaMulti4Pivot5At := na
                        qaMulti4Mss5At := na
                        qaMulti4Pivot15 := na
                        qaMulti4Pivot15At := na
                        qaMulti4Mss15At := na
                        // Extraer MSS M5/M15 exclusivamente del mismo candidato
                        // de C1/C2a/direccion. Nunca prestar pivotes de otra familia.
                        if array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) > 0
                            for idx4 = 0 to array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) - 1
                                Multi4MssCandidate q4 = array.get(qaMulti4MssCandidates, idx4)
                                int dir4 = multiBull ? 1 : -1
                                if q4.c1Start == m1.startAt and q4.c2aStart == m2.startAt and q4.direction == dir4 and not q4.doubleSweep and not na(q4.sweepAt) and q4.sweepAt <= m2.endAt
                                    qaMulti4SweepAt := q4.sweepAt
                                    qaMulti4Pivot5 := q4.pivot5
                                    qaMulti4Pivot5At := q4.pivot5At
                                    qaMulti4Mss5At := q4.mss5At
                                    qaMulti4Pivot15 := q4.pivot15
                                    qaMulti4Pivot15At := q4.pivot15At
                                    qaMulti4Mss15At := q4.mss15At
                                    break
                // Cada H4 completa elegible puede ser una C1 de futuro
                // MULTI4; se mantienen hasta 4 candidatos por feed.
                if f_allowed(hour(h4Bucket, TZ), isIndex)
                    array.push(qaMulti4MssCandidates, Multi4MssCandidate.new(h4Bucket, bucketH4, h4High, h4Low, 0, na, na, na, na, na, na, na, false))
                    if array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) > 4
                        array.shift(qaMulti4MssCandidates)
            // QA MULTI-N: no imponer el MULTI4 distribuido a modelos
            // C1 + N interiores + barrida terminal. Conserva los dos
            // detectores por separado; nunca crea MSS o alertas.
            if not fullH4
                array.clear(qaMultiNHistory)
                qaMultiNKind := "H4 INCOMPLETA"
                qaMultiNAt := na
                qaMultiNC1 := na
                qaMultiNDir := 0
                qaTrue3CPending := na
            else
                array.push(qaMultiNHistory, MultiH4.new(h4Bucket, h4LastEnd, h4High, h4Low, h4Close, true))
                if array.size(qaMultiNHistory) > 7
                    array.shift(qaMultiNHistory)
                int nHistory = array.size(qaMultiNHistory)
                // TRUE 3-CANDLE STRUCTURE (Rowdy slide 8/20):
                // C1 range; CLOSED C2 setup with NO C1 sweep;
                // CLOSED C3 sweeps ONE C1 boundary and returns strictly inside.
                // This is not the legacy 2C whose C3 simply distributes.
                // Source is this symbol's 48-M5/closed-H4 bounded history.
                // An Inside that only sweeps C2 is NOT a true C3 C1 sweep.
                if nHistory >= 3
                    MultiH4 trueC1 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistory - 3)
                    MultiH4 trueC2 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistory - 2)
                    MultiH4 trueC3 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistory - 1)
                    bool threeClosed = trueC1.valid and trueC2.valid and trueC3.valid and trueC1.endAt == trueC2.startAt and trueC2.endAt == trueC3.startAt
                    bool setupNoSweep = trueC2.hi <= trueC1.hi and trueC2.lo >= trueC1.lo and trueC2.cl > trueC1.lo and trueC2.cl < trueC1.hi
                    bool c3LowRaid = trueC3.lo < trueC1.lo and trueC3.hi <= trueC1.hi
                    bool c3HighRaid = trueC3.hi > trueC1.hi and trueC3.lo >= trueC1.lo
                    bool c3ClosesBack = trueC3.cl > trueC1.lo and trueC3.cl < trueC1.hi
                    bool allowedTrue3C = f_allowed(hour(trueC1.startAt, TZ), isIndex)
                    if threeClosed and allowedTrue3C and setupNoSweep and (c3LowRaid != c3HighRaid) and c3ClosesBack
                        // Signed timestamp conserves direction without adding
                        // another field to the near-128-field Signal UDT.
                        // Structural evidence only: MSS5/15 remain UNVERIFIED
                        // until first sweep and pivots are recorded separately.
                        qaTrue3CSignedAt := (c3LowRaid ? 1 : -1) * trueC3.endAt
                        // Aceptar solo el mismo C1 y C3, tras evidencia M5
                        // cerrada y sin barrida contraria; si falta, queda N/V.
                        if not na(qaTrue3CPending)
                            True3CMssCandidate owned3 = qaTrue3CPending
                            int expectedDir3 = c3LowRaid ? 1 : -1
                            if owned3.c1Start == trueC1.startAt and owned3.c3Start == trueC3.startAt and owned3.direction == expectedDir3 and not owned3.doubleSweep and not na(owned3.sweepAt)
                                qaTrue3CConfirmed := owned3
                // Preparar EL PROXIMO C3, solo con C1 y C2 completas,
                // contiguas y sin barrida C1. No usar el MSS de Inside.
                qaTrue3CPending := na
                if nHistory >= 2
                    MultiH4 preC1 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistory - 2)
                    MultiH4 preC2 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistory - 1)
                    bool preReady3 = preC1.valid and preC2.valid and preC1.endAt == preC2.startAt and preC2.endAt == bucketH4 and f_allowed(hour(preC1.startAt, TZ), isIndex) and preC2.hi <= preC1.hi and preC2.lo >= preC1.lo and preC2.cl > preC1.lo and preC2.cl < preC1.hi
                    if preReady3
                        qaTrue3CPending := True3CMssCandidate.new(preC1.startAt, bucketH4, preC1.hi, preC1.lo, 0, na, na, na, na, na, na, na, false)
                if nHistory >= 4
                    bool multiNAuditable = false
                    bool multiNMatched = false
                    bool multiNSawDouble = false
                    bool multiNSawOutside = false
                    bool multiNSawNoTerminal = false
                    // Un mismo C1 puede producir varias interpretaciones.
                    // Preferir la C1 mas reciente (N menor) y registrar
                    // solo una observacion QA por vela terminal.
                    for consolidationCount = 2 to 5
                        int needed = consolidationCount + 2
                        if needed <= nHistory
                            int c1Idx = nHistory - needed
                            MultiH4 beginH4 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, c1Idx)
                            MultiH4 endH4 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistory - 1)
                            bool consecutive = true
                            bool internalBars = true
                            MultiH4 priorH4 = beginH4
                            for j = c1Idx + 1 to nHistory - 1
                                MultiH4 nextBar = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, j)
                                consecutive := consecutive and priorH4.endAt == nextBar.startAt
                                priorH4 := nextBar
                            for j = c1Idx + 1 to nHistory - 2
                                MultiH4 consolidate = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, j)
                                internalBars := internalBars and consolidate.hi < beginH4.hi and consolidate.lo > beginH4.lo
                            bool validTimeC1 = f_allowed(hour(beginH4.startAt, TZ), isIndex)
                            bool sweepLowN = endH4.lo < beginH4.lo and endH4.hi <= beginH4.hi
                            bool sweepHighN = endH4.hi > beginH4.hi and endH4.lo >= beginH4.lo
                            bool returnN = endH4.cl >= beginH4.lo and endH4.cl <= beginH4.hi
                            if consecutive and internalBars and validTimeC1
                                multiNAuditable := true
                                bool sweptBoth = endH4.lo < beginH4.lo and endH4.hi > beginH4.hi
                                multiNSawDouble := multiNSawDouble or sweptBoth
                                multiNSawOutside := multiNSawOutside or (sweepLowN != sweepHighN) and not returnN
                                multiNSawNoTerminal := multiNSawNoTerminal or (not sweepLowN and not sweepHighN and not sweptBoth)
                            if consecutive and internalBars and validTimeC1 and (sweepLowN != sweepHighN) and returnN
                                multiNMatched := true
                                qaAuditMN += 1
                                qaLastMultiNAt := endH4.endAt
                                qaMultiNKind := sweepLowN ? "MULTI-N BULL QA" : "MULTI-N BEAR QA"
                                qaMultiNAt := endH4.endAt
                                qaMultiNC1 := beginH4.startAt
                                qaMultiNDir := sweepLowN ? 1 : -1
                                // Solo extraer MSS del MISMO candidato C1
                                // y H4 terminal, con barrida no ambigua.
                                qaMultiNSweepAt := na
                                qaMultiNPivot15 := na
                                qaMultiNPivot15At := na
                                qaMultiNMss15At := na
                                qaMultiNMss5At := na
                                qaMultiNPivot5 := na
                                qaMultiNPivot5At := na
                                if array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) > 0
                                    for k = 0 to array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) - 1
                                        MultiNMssCandidate qaOwn = array.get(qaMultiNMssCandidates, k)
                                        if qaOwn.c1Start == qaMultiNC1 and qaOwn.terminalH4Start == h4Bucket and qaOwn.direction == qaMultiNDir and not qaOwn.doubleSweep
                                            qaMultiNSweepAt := qaOwn.sweepAt
                                            qaMultiNPivot15 := qaOwn.pivot15
                                            qaMultiNPivot15At := qaOwn.pivot15At
                                            qaMultiNMss15At := qaOwn.mss15At
                                            qaMultiNPivot5 := qaOwn.pivot5
                                            qaMultiNPivot5At := qaOwn.pivot5At
                                            qaMultiNMss5At := qaOwn.mss5At
                                            break
                                break
                    // Solo UNA razon por vela H4 terminal: el mismo cierre
                    // puede cumplir varias N candidatas. No contar intentos
                    // intrabar M5 ni la misma barra dos veces.
                    if multiNAuditable and not multiNMatched
                        if multiNSawDouble
                            qaAuditMNDouble += 1
                        else if multiNSawOutside
                            qaAuditMNOutside += 1
                        else if multiNSawNoTerminal
                            qaAuditMNNoTerminal += 1
            // Los candidatos pertenecen exclusivamente a la H4 que
            // ACABA de cerrar; no se arrastran a un ciclo nuevo.
            array.clear(qaMultiNMssCandidates)
            // C3 solo se invalida por el CIERRE de su H4, NO por cierre M5.
            // La mecha o un cierre intrabar M5 que atraviese el extremo de C2
            // no revocan el CRT cuando la C3 H4 finalmente cierra recuperada.
            if c3Active and c3Start == h4Bucket
                bool validC3Close = fullH4
                bool invalidAtC3Close = validC3Close and not na(c3Invalidation) and (c3Dir == 1 ? h4Close < c3Invalidation : h4Close > c3Invalidation)
                if invalidAtC3Close or not validC3Close
                    qaAuditC3Invalid += 1
                else if validC3Close
                    qaAudit3C += 1
                    qaLastConfirmed3CAt := h4LastEnd
                if (invalidAtC3Close or not validC3Close) and lastC1 == c1Start3
                    lastConfirmedAt := na
                    lastM5 := na
                    lastM15 := na
                    lastModelKind := "NONE"
                    lastPatternValid := false
                    lastModelC1 := na
                c3Active := false
                c3ModelKind := "NONE"
                c3PatternValid := false
                c3ModelC1 := na
                c3C2Start := na

            // M3B.2 INTEGRADO: clasificar solo al cierre H4 de la manipulacion.
            // Una barrida M5 no equivale por si sola a un CRT ratificado.
            if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
                for ic = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                    InsideCandidate cand = array.get(insideCandidates, ic)
                    bool closesSweepH4 = not na(cand.sweepH4Start) and cand.sweepH4Start == h4Bucket
                    if closesSweepH4 and (cand.state == "SWEPT" or cand.state == "AMBIGUOUS")
                        bool closedH4Complete = fullH4
                        if not closedH4Complete
                            qaAuditInsideData += 1
                            cand.state := "DATA_GAP"
                            cand.isPatternValid := false
                        else if cand.state == "AMBIGUOUS" or (cand.sweptLow and cand.sweptHigh)
                            qaAuditInsideDouble += 1
                            cand.state := "AMBIGUOUS"
                            cand.modelKind := "NONE"
                            cand.isPatternValid := false
                        else
                            bool returnC2 = h4Close >= cand.c2Low and h4Close <= cand.c2High
                            if returnC2
                                qaAuditInside += 1
                                qaLastInsideReturnAt := h4LastEnd
                                cand.state := "RATIFIED"
                                cand.modelKind := cand.sweepDir == 1 ? "INSIDE_RETURN_BULL" : "INSIDE_RETURN_BEAR"
                                cand.isPatternValid := true
                            else if h4Close < cand.c1Low or h4Close > cand.c1High
                                qaAuditInsideOther += 1
                                qaLastInsideContinuationAt := h4LastEnd
                                cand.state := "CONTINUATION"
                                cand.modelKind := h4Close < cand.c1Low ? "INSIDE_CONTINUATION_DOWN" : "INSIDE_CONTINUATION_UP"
                                cand.isPatternValid := false // Experimental, sin entradas
                            else
                                // Cierra dentro de C1 pero fuera de C2.
                                qaAuditInsideOther += 1
                                cand.state := "UNRESOLVED"
                                cand.modelKind := "NONE"
                                cand.isPatternValid := false

            // ---- M3B.3B: EXPIRACION Y GAPS (DESPUES de clasificar 3B.2) ----
            // No confundir una pausa normal entre sesiones con un hueco M5
            // interno. Contamos cierres H4 verificados, no tiempo UTC / 4h.
            bool insideH4Closed = fullH4
            if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
                for ageI = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                    InsideCandidate ageCand = array.get(insideCandidates, ageI)
                    bool awaiting = ageCand.state == "SEEKING" or ageCand.state == "SWEPT"
                    bool eligibleH4 = h4Bucket >= ageCand.c2End
                    if awaiting and eligibleH4
                        if not h4Continuous
                            // Hay velas M5 en esta H4 pero falta continuidad interna.
                            qaAuditInsideData += 1
                            ageCand.state := "DATA_GAP"
                            ageCand.isPatternValid := false
                        else if insideH4Closed
                            if ageCand.state == "SEEKING" and (h4Close < ageCand.c1Low or h4Close > ageCand.c1High)
                                qaAuditInsideOther += 1
                                ageCand.state := "INVALIDATED"
                                ageCand.isPatternValid := false
                            else
                                ageCand.h4Life += 1
                                if ageCand.h4Life >= maxH4Life
                                    qaAuditInsideExpire += 1
                                    ageCand.state := "EXPIRED"
                                    ageCand.isPatternValid := false
            // Los estados RATIFIED/CONTINUATION/AMBIGUOUS/UNRESOLVED son
            // terminales: no se reactivan ni consumen mas vida H4.

            // C2 pasa a C3 solo cuando la H4 de C2 CIERRA dentro de C1.
            bool c2Done = c2Active and c2Start == h4Bucket
            if c2Done
                bool inside = h4Close >= c1Low2 and h4Close <= c1High2
                // El modulo 1 permanece OBLIGATORIO para cualquier clasificacion.
                bool validC2Data = fullH4
                // M3B.1: C2 estrictamente interior a C1 al cierre H4 real.
                // No ratifica Inside, no altera C2-sweep, MSS ni dashboard.
                bool strictH4Inside = validC2Data and h4High < c1High2 and h4Low > c1Low2
                if strictH4Inside
                    string insideId = syminfo.tickerid + "|" + str.tostring(c1Start2) + "|INSIDE"
                    bool alreadyStored = false
                    int candidateCount = array.size(insideCandidates)
                    if candidateCount > 0
                        for j = 0 to candidateCount - 1
                            InsideCandidate existing = array.get(insideCandidates, j)
                            if existing.id == insideId
                                alreadyStored := true
                                break
                    if not alreadyStored
                        InsideCandidate cand = InsideCandidate.new(insideId, c1Start2, c1High2, c1Low2, h4High, h4Low, bucketH4, na, na, 0, false, false, "SEEKING", "NONE", false, 0, na, na, na, na, na, na)
                        // Una memoria llena descarta primero terminales sin
                        // ratificacion, despues SEEKING, SWEPT y finalmente
                        // el RATIFIED mas antiguo si todos son importantes.
                        if array.size(insideCandidates) >= 10
                            int dropIdx = na
                            for tier = 0 to 3
                                if na(dropIdx)
                                    for mi = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                                        string st = array.get(insideCandidates, mi).state
                                        bool discardable = tier == 0 ? (st == "EXPIRED" or st == "INVALIDATED" or st == "DATA_GAP" or st == "AMBIGUOUS" or st == "UNRESOLVED" or st == "CONTINUATION") : tier == 1 ? st == "SEEKING" : tier == 2 ? st == "SWEPT" : st == "RATIFIED"
                                        if discardable
                                            dropIdx := mi
                                            break
                            array.remove(insideCandidates, na(dropIdx) ? 0 : dropIdx)
                        array.push(insideCandidates, cand)
                bool strictSingleSweep = c2Dir != 0 and c2StrictSweep and not c2Double
                bool expansionBull = c2Dir == 1 and h4Close < c1Low2
                bool expansionBear = c2Dir == -1 and h4Close > c1High2
                string classified2C = "NONE"
                if validC2Data and strictSingleSweep
                    if inside and c2Returned
                        classified2C := "CRT_2C_RETURN"
                    else if expansionBull or expansionBear
                        classified2C := "CRT_2C_EXPANSION"  // Solo diagnostico, NUNCA ratificado
                last2CClassification := classified2C
                last2CClassificationAt := bucketH4
                if classified2C == "CRT_2C_EXPANSION"
                    qaLastRejectedExpansionAt := h4LastEnd
                bool validRange = classified2C == "CRT_2C_RETURN"
                bool exactHour3 = hour(bucketH4, TZ) == ((hour(c1Start2, TZ) + 8) % 24)
                // Una causa por cierre de C2; son descartes H4, no
                // señales. Incluye BTC, FX e indices del feed actual.
                if not validC2Data
                    qaAuditC2Data += 1
                else if c2Double
                    qaAuditC2Double += 1
                else if not strictSingleSweep
                    qaAuditC2NoSweep += 1
                else if not inside or not c2Returned
                    qaAuditC2Outside += 1
                else if not exactHour3
                    qaAuditC2Hour += 1
                if isBTC
                    qaLastC2Gate := not validC2Data ? "C2 M5 NO 48" : c2Double ? "C2 DOBLE BARRIDA" : not strictSingleSweep ? "C2 SIN BARRIDA" : not inside ? "C2 CIERRE FUERA" : not c2Returned ? "C2 SIN RETORNO" : not exactHour3 ? "C3 HORA INVALIDA" : "CRT C2 RATIFICADO"
                if validRange and exactHour3
                    qaAudit2C += 1
                    qaLastRatified2CAt := h4LastEnd
                    if isBTC
                        qaC2Ratified += 1
                    // Registrar el CRT al CIERRE H4 de C2. M5/M15 se
                    // conservan solo si ya se confirmaron en esa C2.
                    lastC1 := c1Start2
                    lastDir := c2Dir
                    lastConfirmedAt := bucketH4
                    lastHi := c1High2
                    lastLo := c1Low2
                    lastSweepAt := c2SweepEnd
                    lastM5 := c2M5At
                    lastM15 := c2M15At
                    lastM5Level := c2Pivot5
                    lastM15Level := c2Pivot15
                    lastM5PivotAt := c2Pivot5At
                    lastM15PivotAt := c2Pivot15At
                    lastModelKind := classified2C
                    lastPatternValid := true
                    lastModelC1 := c1Start2
                    lastC2Start := c2Start
                    c3ModelKind := classified2C
                    c3PatternValid := true
                    c3ModelC1 := c1Start2
                    c3C2Start := c2Start
                    c3Active := true
                    c3Start := bucketH4
                    c1Start3 := c1Start2
                    c1High3 := c1High2
                    c1Low3 := c1Low2
                    c3Dir := c2Dir
                    c3SweepEnd := c2SweepEnd
                    c3Pivot5 := c2Pivot5
                    c3Pivot15 := c2Pivot15
                    c3Pivot5At := c2Pivot5At
                    c3Pivot15At := c2Pivot15At
                    c3M5At := c2M5At
                    c3M15At := c2M15At
                    c3Invalidation := c2Dir == 1 ? h4Low : h4High
                c2Active := false

            // La H4 que acaba de cerrar puede ser C1 del SIGUIENTE ciclo,
            // incluso si la H4 nueva ya es C3 de un ciclo anterior.
            c2Active := false
            c2Dir := 0
            c2StrictSweep := false
            c2Double := false
            c2Returned := false
            c2SweepEnd := na
            c2M5At := na
            c2M15At := na
            c2Pivot5 := na
            c2Pivot15 := na
            c2Pivot5At := na
            c2Pivot15At := na
            int lastC1Hour = hour(h4Bucket, TZ)
            int expectedC2 = (lastC1Hour + 4) % 24
            bool c1AllowedHour = f_allowed(lastC1Hour, isIndex)
            bool c1AlignedNext = hour(bucketH4, TZ) == expectedC2
            bool c1CompleteData = fullH4
            bool c1HasRange = h4High > h4Low
            // Cada cierre elegible por HORA aporta exactamente una
            // clasificación: mala ancla, datos, rango o C1 apta.
            if c1AllowedHour
                qaAuditC1HourCandidates += 1
                if not c1AlignedNext
                    qaAuditC1BadClock += 1
                else if not c1CompleteData
                    qaAuditC1BadData += 1
                else if not c1HasRange
                    qaAuditC1BadRange += 1
            if c1AllowedHour and c1AlignedNext and c1CompleteData and c1HasRange
                c2Active := true
                // BUG corregido V34.10v: este contador ES por feed.
                // Antes solo incrementaba en BTC pero audit2C sí
                // sumaba Forex/índices, generando el imposible 5/0.
                qaC1Ready += 1
                if isBTC
                    qaLastC2Gate := "C1 VALIDA ESPERA C2"
                c2Start := bucketH4
                c1Start2 := h4Bucket
                c1High2 := h4High
                c1Low2 := h4Low

            h4Bucket := bucketH4
            h4High := bH
            h4Low := bL
            h4Close := bC
            h4Count := 1
            h4FirstT := barT
            h4LastEnd := barEnd
            h4Continuous := true
        else if na(h4Bucket)
            h4Bucket := bucketH4
            h4High := bH
            h4Low := bL
            h4Close := bC
            h4Count := 1
            h4FirstT := barT
            h4LastEnd := barEnd
            h4Continuous := true
        else
            h4Continuous := h4Continuous and barT == h4LastEnd
            h4High := math.max(h4High, bH)
            h4Low := math.min(h4Low, bL)
            h4Close := bC
            h4Count += 1
            h4LastEnd := barEnd

    // ---- M4B: ESTADO DE LIQUIDEZ DE LA SESION DE REFERENCIA ----
    // M4A ya procesó esta M5 cerrada. Después del cambio H4,
    // c2Active/c3Active corresponden al H4 actual, incluso en su primera M5.
    bool hasLiquidityRef = prev_valid and not na(prev_timestamp) and not na(prev_PDH) and not na(prev_PDL)
    if not hasLiquidityRef
        liquidityRefAt := na
        pdhTaken := false
        pdlTaken := false
        pdhSweepAt := na
        pdlSweepAt := na
        pdhSweepStage := 0
        pdlSweepStage := 0
        pdhSweepC1 := na
        pdlSweepC1 := na
    else
        if na(liquidityRefAt) or liquidityRefAt != prev_timestamp
            liquidityRefAt := prev_timestamp
            pdhTaken := false
            pdlTaken := false
            pdhSweepAt := na
            pdlSweepAt := na
            pdhSweepStage := 0
            pdlSweepStage := 0
            pdhSweepC1 := na
            pdlSweepC1 := na
        // No comparar velas del dia anterior con el nuevo PDH/PDL,
        // ni after-hours con niveles RTH. Solo M5 cerrada elegible.
        bool eligibleLiquidityBar = pdhInSession and not na(barT) and not na(barEnd) and barT >= liquidityRefAt
        if eligibleLiquidityBar
            int eventStage = c3Active and bucketH4 == c3Start ? 3 : c2Active and bucketH4 == c2Start ? 2 : 0
            int eventC1 = eventStage == 3 ? c1Start3 : eventStage == 2 ? c1Start2 : na
            if not pdhTaken and bH > prev_PDH
                pdhTaken := true
                pdhSweepAt := barEnd
                pdhSweepStage := eventStage
                pdhSweepC1 := eventC1
            if not pdlTaken and bL < prev_PDL
                pdlTaken := true
                pdlSweepAt := barEnd
                pdlSweepStage := eventStage
                pdlSweepC1 := eventC1

    // ---- M3B.2 INTEGRADO: PRIMERA BARRIDA M5 DE INSIDE BAR ----
    // M5 cerrada [1]; solo despues del cierre H4 de C2.
    // Se rastrean ambos extremos durante una MISMA H4 de manipulacion.
    if not na(barT) and not na(bucketH4) and array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
        for ic = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
            InsideCandidate cand = array.get(insideCandidates, ic)
            if cand.state == "SEEKING" and barT >= cand.c2End
                bool brokeLow = bL < cand.c2Low
                bool brokeHigh = bH > cand.c2High
                if brokeLow or brokeHigh
                    cand.sweepAt := barEnd
                    cand.sweepH4Start := bucketH4
                    cand.sweptLow := brokeLow
                    cand.sweptHigh := brokeHigh
                    cand.sweepDir := brokeLow and not brokeHigh ? 1 : brokeHigh and not brokeLow ? -1 : 0
                    cand.state := brokeLow and brokeHigh ? "AMBIGUOUS" : "SWEPT"
                    // C1 y pivote son DEL Inside. Solo la primera M5
                    // barrida congela un pivote M15 anterior y confirmado.
                    bool freshInside15 = cand.sweepDir == 1 ? not na(lastHigh15At) and lastHigh15At < barT and barT - lastHigh15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : cand.sweepDir == -1 ? not na(lastLow15At) and lastLow15At < barT and barT - lastLow15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : false
                    cand.pivot15 := freshInside15 ? (cand.sweepDir == 1 ? lastHigh15 : lastLow15) : na
                    cand.pivot15At := freshInside15 ? (cand.sweepDir == 1 ? lastHigh15At : lastLow15At) : na
                    cand.mss15At := na
                    bool freshInside5 = cand.sweepDir == 1 ? not na(lastHigh5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastHigh5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastHigh5At < barT and barT - lastHigh5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : cand.sweepDir == -1 ? not na(lastLow5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastLow5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastLow5At < barT and barT - lastLow5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : false
                    cand.pivot5 := freshInside5 ? (cand.sweepDir == 1 ? lastHigh5 : lastLow5) : na
                    cand.pivot5At := freshInside5 ? (cand.sweepDir == 1 ? lastHigh5At : lastLow5At) : na
                    cand.mss5At := na
            else if cand.state == "SWEPT" and bucketH4 == cand.sweepH4Start
                cand.sweptLow := cand.sweptLow or bL < cand.c2Low
                cand.sweptHigh := cand.sweptHigh or bH > cand.c2High
                if cand.sweptLow and cand.sweptHigh
                    cand.sweepDir := 0
                    cand.state := "AMBIGUOUS"
                    cand.mss15At := na
                    cand.pivot15 := na
                    cand.pivot15At := na
                    cand.mss5At := na
                    cand.pivot5 := na
                    cand.pivot5At := na

    // Barrida inicial de TRUE 3C en la C3 propia: solo M5 cerradas,
    // niveles de C1 propia, doble barrida bloqueante y pivotes congelados.
    if not na(qaTrue3CPending) and not na(barT) and bucketH4 == qaTrue3CPending.c3Start
        True3CMssCandidate q3 = qaTrue3CPending
        bool low3 = bL < q3.c1Low
        bool high3 = bH > q3.c1High
        if q3.direction == 0 and not q3.doubleSweep and (low3 or high3)
            if low3 and high3
                q3.doubleSweep := true
            else
                q3.direction := low3 ? 1 : -1
                q3.sweepAt := barEnd
                bool fresh3M5 = q3.direction == 1 ? not na(lastHigh5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastHigh5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastHigh5At < barT and barT - lastHigh5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : not na(lastLow5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastLow5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastLow5At < barT and barT - lastLow5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000
                q3.pivot5 := fresh3M5 ? (q3.direction == 1 ? lastHigh5 : lastLow5) : na
                q3.pivot5At := fresh3M5 ? (q3.direction == 1 ? lastHigh5At : lastLow5At) : na
                bool fresh3M15 = q3.direction == 1 ? not na(lastHigh15At) and lastHigh15At < barT and barT - lastHigh15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : not na(lastLow15At) and lastLow15At < barT and barT - lastLow15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000
                q3.pivot15 := fresh3M15 ? (q3.direction == 1 ? lastHigh15 : lastLow15) : na
                q3.pivot15At := fresh3M15 ? (q3.direction == 1 ? lastHigh15At : lastLow15At) : na
        else if q3.direction != 0 and (low3 and high3 or q3.direction == 1 and high3 or q3.direction == -1 and low3)
            q3.doubleSweep := true
            q3.mss5At := na
            q3.mss15At := na
            q3.pivot5 := na
            q3.pivot5At := na
            q3.pivot15 := na
            q3.pivot15At := na

    // Multi4: la primera barrida debe ocurrir en C2a, no en C2b/C3.
    // Hasta cerrar CUATRO H4 completas, esta evidencia es solo candidata.
    if not na(barT) and array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) > 0
        for idx4 = 0 to array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) - 1
            Multi4MssCandidate q4 = array.get(qaMulti4MssCandidates, idx4)
            bool inMulti4Window = bucketH4 >= q4.c2aStart and bucketH4 < q4.c2aStart + 3 * H4MS
            if inMulti4Window and not q4.doubleSweep
                bool low4 = bL < q4.c1Low
                bool high4 = bH > q4.c1High
                if bucketH4 == q4.c2aStart and q4.direction == 0 and (low4 or high4)
                    if low4 and high4
                        q4.doubleSweep := true
                    else
                        q4.direction := low4 ? 1 : -1
                        q4.sweepAt := barEnd
                        bool fresh4M5 = q4.direction == 1 ? not na(lastHigh5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastHigh5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastHigh5At < barT and barT - lastHigh5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : not na(lastLow5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastLow5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastLow5At < barT and barT - lastLow5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000
                        q4.pivot5 := fresh4M5 ? (q4.direction == 1 ? lastHigh5 : lastLow5) : na
                        q4.pivot5At := fresh4M5 ? (q4.direction == 1 ? lastHigh5At : lastLow5At) : na
                        bool fresh4M15 = q4.direction == 1 ? not na(lastHigh15At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastHigh15At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastHigh15At < barT and barT - lastHigh15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : not na(lastLow15At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastLow15At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastLow15At < barT and barT - lastLow15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000
                        q4.pivot15 := fresh4M15 ? (q4.direction == 1 ? lastHigh15 : lastLow15) : na
                        q4.pivot15At := fresh4M15 ? (q4.direction == 1 ? lastHigh15At : lastLow15At) : na
                else if q4.direction != 0 and (low4 and high4 or q4.direction == 1 and high4 or q4.direction == -1 and low4)
                    // Cualquier segunda barrida del extremo contrario
                    // en C2a/C2b/C3 invalida ambos MSS propios (M5/M15).
                    q4.doubleSweep := true
                    q4.mss5At := na
                    q4.mss15At := na
                    q4.pivot5 := na
                    q4.pivot5At := na
                    q4.pivot15 := na
                    q4.pivot15At := na

    // Multi-N propio: antes de cerrar H4 terminal, cada C1 viable
    // tiene un candidato diferente (max. 4). No usar el MSS del CRT 3C.
    // La validacion ESTRUCTURAL sigue ocurriendo al cierre H4.
    if not na(barT) and not na(bucketH4) and array.size(qaMultiNHistory) >= 3
        int nHistoryMss = array.size(qaMultiNHistory)
        MultiH4 latestClosed = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, nHistoryMss - 1)
        if latestClosed.endAt == bucketH4
            for consolidationCount = 2 to 5
                int needed = consolidationCount + 1
                if needed <= nHistoryMss
                    int beginIndex = nHistoryMss - needed
                    MultiH4 firstClosed = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, beginIndex)
                    MultiH4 priorClosed = firstClosed
                    bool chainOk = true
                    bool insideOk = true
                    for j = beginIndex + 1 to nHistoryMss - 1
                        MultiH4 currentClosed = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, j)
                        chainOk := chainOk and currentClosed.startAt == priorClosed.endAt
                        insideOk := insideOk and currentClosed.hi < firstClosed.hi and currentClosed.lo > firstClosed.lo
                        priorClosed := currentClosed
                    bool validMN = chainOk and insideOk and f_allowed(hour(firstClosed.startAt, TZ), isIndex)
                    if validMN
                        bool lowSweep = bL < firstClosed.lo
                        bool highSweep = bH > firstClosed.hi
                        if lowSweep or highSweep
                            int candidateIndex = na
                            if array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) > 0
                                for k = 0 to array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) - 1
                                    MultiNMssCandidate existing = array.get(qaMultiNMssCandidates, k)
                                    if existing.c1Start == firstClosed.startAt and existing.terminalH4Start == bucketH4
                                        candidateIndex := k
                                        break
                            if na(candidateIndex)
                                int candidateDir = lowSweep and not highSweep ? 1 : highSweep and not lowSweep ? -1 : 0
                                bool freshMN15 = candidateDir == 1 ? not na(lastHigh15At) and lastHigh15At < barT and barT - lastHigh15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : candidateDir == -1 ? not na(lastLow15At) and lastLow15At < barT and barT - lastLow15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : false
                                float frozenLevel = freshMN15 ? (candidateDir == 1 ? lastHigh15 : lastLow15) : na
                                int frozenAt = freshMN15 ? (candidateDir == 1 ? lastHigh15At : lastLow15At) : na
                                bool freshMN5 = candidateDir == 1 ? not na(lastHigh5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastHigh5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastHigh5At < barT and barT - lastHigh5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : candidateDir == -1 ? not na(lastLow5At) and not na(qaExtraM5SegmentStart) and lastLow5At >= qaExtraM5SegmentStart and lastLow5At < barT and barT - lastLow5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000 : false
                                float frozenLevel5 = freshMN5 ? (candidateDir == 1 ? lastHigh5 : lastLow5) : na
                                int frozenAt5 = freshMN5 ? (candidateDir == 1 ? lastHigh5At : lastLow5At) : na
                                array.push(qaMultiNMssCandidates, MultiNMssCandidate.new(firstClosed.startAt, bucketH4, candidateDir, barEnd, frozenLevel, frozenAt, na, lowSweep and highSweep, frozenLevel5, frozenAt5, na))
                            else
                                MultiNMssCandidate existing = array.get(qaMultiNMssCandidates, candidateIndex)
                                bool bothSides = lowSweep and highSweep or existing.direction == 1 and highSweep or existing.direction == -1 and lowSweep
                                if bothSides
                                    existing.doubleSweep := true
                                    existing.mss15At := na
                                    existing.pivot15 := na
                                    existing.pivot15At := na
                                    existing.mss5At := na
                                    existing.pivot5 := na
                                    existing.pivot5At := na
    // ---- M5B CANDIDATO: SEGUIMIENTO FVG H1/H4 EN ESTA M5 CERRADA ----
    // Va despues de crear FVG nuevos en el cambio de H1/H4: permite que
    // la primera M5 de la siguiente ventana toque el FVG recien confirmado.
    if not na(barT) and not na(barEnd)
        if array.size(fvgsH1) > 0
            for fi = 0 to array.size(fvgsH1) - 1
                FvgContext zoneH1 = array.get(fvgsH1, fi)
                f_update_context_fvg(zoneH1, barT, barEnd, bL, bH, bC, firstSession5, lastSession5)
        if array.size(fvgsH4) > 0
            for fi = 0 to array.size(fvgsH4) - 1
                FvgContext zoneH4 = array.get(fvgsH4, fi)
                f_update_context_fvg(zoneH4, barT, barEnd, bL, bH, bC, firstSession5, lastSession5)

    // ---- BARRIDA Y RETORNO C2 (velas M5 cerradas) ----
    // QA: tocar CRH/CRL (igualdad) solo puede crear un C2 PROVISIONAL.
    // Direccion y c2Double definitivos dependen EXCLUSIVAMENTE de barridas estrictas.
    if c2Active and not na(barT) and bucketH4 == c2Start
        bool strictLow = bL < c1Low2
        bool strictHigh = bH > c1High2
        bool touchLow = bL <= c1Low2
        bool touchHigh = bH >= c1High2
        // Dos extremos estrictamente barridos, incluso en una unica M5.
        if strictLow and strictHigh
            c2Double := true
        if c2Dir == 0 and not c2Double
            if strictLow != strictHigh
                c2Dir := strictLow ? 1 : -1
            else if allowTouches and touchLow != touchHigh
                // Toque exacto unilateral: provisional, sin MSS confirmado.
                c2Dir := touchLow ? 1 : -1
        if c2Dir != 0 and not c2Double
            bool chosenStrict = c2Dir == 1 ? strictLow : strictHigh
            bool oppositeStrict = c2Dir == 1 ? strictHigh : strictLow
            // Si solo hubo toque preliminar, la PRIMERA barrida REAL elige
            // la direccion, aun si ocurre en el lado opuesto al toque.
            if not c2StrictSweep and oppositeStrict and not chosenStrict
                c2Dir := -c2Dir
                chosenStrict := true
                oppositeStrict := false
                c2Returned := false
            // Descartar UNICAMENTE cuando se han barrido estrictamente
            // ambos limites; un toque exacto del otro lado NO basta.
            if c2StrictSweep and oppositeStrict
                c2Double := true
            if not c2Double
                bool firstStrictSweep = not c2StrictSweep and chosenStrict
                if firstStrictSweep
                    c2StrictSweep := true
                    c2SweepEnd := barEnd
                    c2Returned := false
                    bool lowSide = c2Dir == 1
                    bool fresh5 = lowSide ? (not na(lastHigh5At) and lastHigh5At < barT and barT - lastHigh5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000) : (not na(lastLow5At) and lastLow5At < barT and barT - lastLow5At <= maxPivotAge * 60000)
                    bool fresh15 = lowSide ? (not na(lastHigh15At) and lastHigh15At < barT and barT - lastHigh15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000) : (not na(lastLow15At) and lastLow15At < barT and barT - lastLow15At <= maxPivotAge * 60000)
                    c2Pivot5 := fresh5 ? (lowSide ? lastHigh5 : lastLow5) : na
                    c2Pivot15 := fresh15 ? (lowSide ? lastHigh15 : lastLow15) : na
                    c2Pivot5At := fresh5 ? (lowSide ? lastHigh5At : lastLow5At) : na
                    c2Pivot15At := fresh15 ? (lowSide ? lastHigh15At : lastLow15At) : na
                c2Returned := c2Returned or (bC >= c1Low2 and bC <= c1High2)
                // MSS M5 no puede ocurrir ANTES NI DURANTE la vela de barrida.
                bool cross5 = c2Dir == 1 ? (not na(c2Pivot5) and bC > c2Pivot5 and prevClose <= c2Pivot5) : (not na(c2Pivot5) and bC < c2Pivot5 and prevClose >= c2Pivot5)
                if c2StrictSweep and previousM5Continuous and barT >= c2SweepEnd and cross5 and na(c2M5At)
                    c2M5At := barEnd

    // ---- MSS en C3 ratificada (misma direccion, mismo swing congelado) ----
    if c3Active and not na(barT) and bucketH4 == c3Start
        // No invalidar aqui por una vela M5. Solo el cierre H4 completo
        // de C3 puede atravesar la mecha de C2 para invalidar el CRT.
        bool cross5c3 = c3Dir == 1 ? (not na(c3Pivot5) and bC > c3Pivot5 and prevClose <= c3Pivot5) : (not na(c3Pivot5) and bC < c3Pivot5 and prevClose >= c3Pivot5)
        if c3Active and previousM5Continuous and barEnd > c3Start and barEnd > c3SweepEnd and cross5c3 and na(c3M5At)
            c3M5At := barEnd
            if lastC1 == c1Start3
                lastM5 := barEnd

    // 3C TRUE M5 propio: cierre cruzado posterior al sweep de C3.
    // No se acepta la vela de la barrida ni se copia MSS del 2C.
    if previousM5Continuous and not na(qaTrue3CPending) and bucketH4 == qaTrue3CPending.c3Start
        True3CMssCandidate q3 = qaTrue3CPending
        bool eligible3M5 = q3.direction != 0 and not q3.doubleSweep and not na(q3.sweepAt) and not na(q3.pivot5) and not na(q3.pivot5At) and q3.pivot5At < q3.sweepAt and barT >= q3.sweepAt and barEnd <= q3.c3Start + H4MS and na(q3.mss5At)
        bool crossed3M5 = q3.direction == 1 ? bC > q3.pivot5 and prevClose <= q3.pivot5 : q3.direction == -1 ? bC < q3.pivot5 and prevClose >= q3.pivot5 : false
        if eligible3M5 and crossed3M5
            q3.mss5At := barEnd

    // MSS M5 Multi4: solo el pivote congelado en C2a, cierre posterior
    // y continuo hasta C3 (cuarta H4), sin arrastre de Inside/Multi-N.
    if previousM5Continuous and array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) > 0
        for idx4 = 0 to array.size(qaMulti4MssCandidates) - 1
            Multi4MssCandidate q4 = array.get(qaMulti4MssCandidates, idx4)
            bool eligible4M5 = q4.direction != 0 and not q4.doubleSweep and not na(q4.sweepAt) and not na(q4.pivot5) and not na(q4.pivot5At) and q4.pivot5At < q4.sweepAt and barT >= q4.sweepAt and barEnd <= q4.c2aStart + 3 * H4MS and bucketH4 >= q4.c2aStart and na(q4.mss5At)
            bool cross4M5 = q4.direction == 1 ? bC > q4.pivot5 and prevClose <= q4.pivot5 : q4.direction == -1 ? bC < q4.pivot5 and prevClose >= q4.pivot5 : false
            if eligible4M5 and cross4M5
                q4.mss5At := barEnd

    // QA M5 causal para Inside y Multi-N; no se hereda el MSS 2C.
    // Solo M5 cerradas y CONTIGUAS, pivote congelado en primera barrida,
    // posterior al sweep, dentro de su propia ventana de H4.
    if previousM5Continuous and not na(barT) and not na(barEnd)
        if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
            for k5 = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                InsideCandidate own5 = array.get(insideCandidates, k5)
                bool eligibleInside5 = (own5.state == "SWEPT" or own5.state == "RATIFIED") and own5.sweepDir != 0 and own5.sweptLow != own5.sweptHigh and not na(own5.sweepAt) and not na(own5.sweepH4Start) and not na(own5.pivot5) and not na(own5.pivot5At) and own5.pivot5At < own5.sweepAt and na(own5.mss5At) and barT >= own5.sweepAt and barEnd <= own5.sweepH4Start + 2 * H4MS
                bool crossedInside5 = own5.sweepDir == 1 ? bC > own5.pivot5 and prevClose <= own5.pivot5 : own5.sweepDir == -1 ? bC < own5.pivot5 and prevClose >= own5.pivot5 : false
                if eligibleInside5 and crossedInside5
                    own5.mss5At := barEnd
        if array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) > 0
            for k5 = 0 to array.size(qaMultiNMssCandidates) - 1
                MultiNMssCandidate ownN5 = array.get(qaMultiNMssCandidates, k5)
                bool eligibleMultiN5 = not ownN5.doubleSweep and ownN5.direction != 0 and not na(ownN5.sweepAt) and not na(ownN5.pivot5) and not na(ownN5.pivot5At) and ownN5.pivot5At < ownN5.sweepAt and na(ownN5.mss5At) and barT >= ownN5.sweepAt and barEnd <= ownN5.terminalH4Start + H4MS and bucketH4 == ownN5.terminalH4Start
                bool crossedMultiN5 = ownN5.direction == 1 ? bC > ownN5.pivot5 and prevClose <= ownN5.pivot5 : ownN5.direction == -1 ? bC < ownN5.pivot5 and prevClose >= ownN5.pivot5 : false
                if eligibleMultiN5 and crossedMultiN5
                    ownN5.mss5At := barEnd

    // Actualizar swing M5 DESPUES de la barrida: no congelar un pivot que
    // acababa de confirmarse simultaneamente con la vela de manipulacion.
    if not na(pH5)
        lastHigh5 := pH5
        lastHigh5At := time[right5 + 1]
    if not na(pL5)
        lastLow5 := pL5
        lastLow5At := time[right5 + 1]

    // Priorizar el CRT ratificado en C3 sobre una NUEVA C2 provisional
    // superpuesta. La nueva C2 permanece registrada internamente y se
    // mostrara cuando termine la C3, si aun continua vigente.
    bool partial = showCandidate and c2Active and c2Dir != 0 and not c2Double and (showAtSweep or c2Returned)
    if partial and (na(qaLastCandidate2CCycle) or qaLastCandidate2CCycle != c2Start)
        qaLastCandidate2CCycle := c2Start
        qaLastCandidate2CAt := barEnd
    bool recent = keepLastCRT and not na(lastConfirmedAt) and barEnd >= lastConfirmedAt and barEnd - lastConfirmedAt <= keepHours * 3600000
    int outPhase = c3Active ? 2 : partial ? 1 : recent ? 3 : 0
    int outDir = outPhase == 2 ? c3Dir : outPhase == 1 ? c2Dir : outPhase == 3 ? lastDir : 0
    int outC1 = outPhase == 2 ? c1Start3 : outPhase == 1 ? c1Start2 : outPhase == 3 ? lastC1 : na
    int outC2Start = outPhase == 2 ? c3C2Start : outPhase == 1 ? c2Start : outPhase == 3 ? lastC2Start : na
    float outHi = outPhase == 2 ? c1High3 : outPhase == 1 ? c1High2 : outPhase == 3 ? lastHi : na
    float outLo = outPhase == 2 ? c1Low3 : outPhase == 1 ? c1Low2 : outPhase == 3 ? lastLo : na
    int outSweep = outPhase == 2 ? c3SweepEnd : outPhase == 1 ? c2SweepEnd : outPhase == 3 ? lastSweepAt : na
    int outM5At = outPhase == 2 ? c3M5At : outPhase == 1 ? c2M5At : outPhase == 3 ? lastM5 : na
    int outM15At = outPhase == 2 ? c3M15At : outPhase == 1 ? c2M15At : outPhase == 3 ? lastM15 : na
    float outM5Level = outPhase == 2 ? c3Pivot5 : outPhase == 1 ? c2Pivot5 : outPhase == 3 ? lastM5Level : na
    float outM15Level = outPhase == 2 ? c3Pivot15 : outPhase == 1 ? c2Pivot15 : outPhase == 3 ? lastM15Level : na
    int outM5PivotAt = outPhase == 2 ? c3Pivot5At : outPhase == 1 ? c2Pivot5At : outPhase == 3 ? lastM5PivotAt : na
    int outM15PivotAt = outPhase == 2 ? c3Pivot15At : outPhase == 1 ? c2Pivot15At : outPhase == 3 ? lastM15PivotAt : na
    // El modelo es metadato independiente; phase y ticks MSS no cambian.
    bool c3IdentityOK = outPhase == 2 and c3ModelC1 == outC1
    bool lastIdentityOK = outPhase == 3 and lastModelC1 == outC1
    bool rejectedRecent = outPhase == 0 and last2CClassification == "CRT_2C_EXPANSION" and not na(last2CClassificationAt) and barEnd >= last2CClassificationAt and barEnd - last2CClassificationAt < H4MS
    string outModel = c3IdentityOK ? c3ModelKind : outPhase == 1 ? "PENDING" : lastIdentityOK ? lastModelKind : rejectedRecent ? "CRT_2C_EXPANSION" : "NONE"
    bool outValid = c3IdentityOK ? c3PatternValid : lastIdentityOK ? lastPatternValid : false
    string outPdhStatus = hasLiquidityRef ? (pdhTaken ? "TAKEN" : "INTACTO") : "N/D"
    string outPdlStatus = hasLiquidityRef ? (pdlTaken ? "TAKEN" : "INTACTO") : "N/D"
    bool pdhInDisplayedCRT = pdhTaken and outPhase > 0 and pdhSweepC1 == outC1 and (pdhSweepStage == 2 or pdhSweepStage == 3)
    bool pdlInDisplayedCRT = pdlTaken and outPhase > 0 and pdlSweepC1 == outC1 and (pdlSweepStage == 2 or pdlSweepStage == 3)
    // QA SOLO: FVG mas recientemente FORMADO en cada TF (no el ultimo vigente).
    int qaCountH1 = array.size(fvgsH1)
    int qaCodeH1 = -1
    float qaTopH1 = na
    float qaBottomH1 = na
    float qaPenH1 = na
    int qaFormH1 = na
    int qaGapH1 = na
    if qaCountH1 > 0
        FvgContext qaH1 = array.get(fvgsH1, qaCountH1 - 1)
        qaCodeH1 := f_fvg_code(qaH1.state)
        qaTopH1 := qaH1.top
        qaBottomH1 := qaH1.bottom
        qaPenH1 := qaH1.maxPenetration * 100.0
        qaFormH1 := qaH1.formedAt
        qaGapH1 := qaH1.gapObservedAt
    int qaCountH4 = array.size(fvgsH4)
    int qaCodeH4 = -1
    float qaTopH4 = na
    float qaBottomH4 = na
    float qaPenH4 = na
    int qaFormH4 = na
    int qaGapH4 = na
    if qaCountH4 > 0
        FvgContext qaH4 = array.get(fvgsH4, qaCountH4 - 1)
        qaCodeH4 := f_fvg_code(qaH4.state)
        qaTopH4 := qaH4.top
        qaBottomH4 := qaH4.bottom
        qaPenH4 := qaH4.maxPenetration * 100.0
        qaFormH4 := qaH4.formedAt
        qaGapH4 := qaH4.gapObservedAt
    // No promover un MSS M5 a MSS M15 ni aceptar un cierre de 15m
    // no visto por el agregador M15 del mismo proveedor.
    bool validIndependent15 = not na(outM15At) and not na(outM15Level) and not na(outM15PivotAt) and not na(outSweep) and outM15PivotAt < outSweep and outM15At > outSweep and f_m15_phase_ok(outM15At, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin) and not na(lastCompleteM15CloseAt) and outM15At <= lastCompleteM15CloseAt
    int verifiedM15At = validIndependent15 ? outM15At : na
    // Clasificador QA de MODELOS, sin cambiar CRT ni eventos M5/M15.
    // BTC+Forex mantienen C1, C2 y C3 H4 consecutivas obligatorias.
    // Los modelos 2C, expansion e Inside NO se promueven a entradas
    // por su etiqueta: esperan CRT 3C ratificado + MSS M15 cerrado.
    string entryFamily = "NINGUNO"
    string entryStage = "SIN CRT"
    int entryConfirmedAt = na
    if outPhase == 1
        entryFamily := "CRT 2C CANDIDATO"
        entryStage := "ESPERA CIERRE C2"
    else if outPhase == 2 and outValid and outModel == "CRT_2C_RETURN"
        bool confirmedM15 = not na(verifiedM15At) and not na(outM15PivotAt) and not na(outSweep) and outM15PivotAt < outSweep
        if confirmedM15
            // Confirmacion M15 en C2 se acepta SOLO tras ratificar C2.
            bool m15WasC2 = not na(c3Start) and verifiedM15At <= c3Start
            entryFamily := m15WasC2 ? "CRT 3C REV MSS C2" : "CRT 3C REV MSS C3"
            entryStage := "M15 CONFIRMADO"
            entryConfirmedAt := m15WasC2 ? c3Start : verifiedM15At
        else
            entryFamily := "CRT 3C REVERSAL"
            entryStage := "ESPERA MSS M15"
    else if rejectedRecent
        entryFamily := "CRT EXPANSION"
        entryStage := "DIAG NO ENTRADA"
    else if outPhase == 3
        entryFamily := "CRT 3C HISTORICO"
        entryStage := "EXPIRADO"
    // Familias extra: diagnostico de 4 H4 / retest M15 posterior.
    // Ninguna crea confirmacion de entrada, y caducan con su contexto.
    bool multiVisible = not na(qaMulti4At) and barEnd >= qaMulti4At and barEnd - qaMulti4At <= H4MS
    string outMulti4Kind = multiVisible ? qaMulti4Kind : "MULTI4 ESP"
    // Exigir evidencia coherente con el MSS M15 expuesto por este mismo CRT.
    // Guarda contra un retest antiguo, un cambio de pivot o OHLC incongruente.
    bool retestOHLCValid = not na(qaRetest15At) and not na(qaRetestSourceMssAt) and not na(qaRetest15Pivot) and not na(qaRetest15High) and not na(qaRetest15Low) and not na(qaRetest15Close) and qaRetest15High >= qaRetest15Low and qaRetest15Close <= qaRetest15High and qaRetest15Close >= qaRetest15Low and qaRetest15At > qaRetestSourceMssAt and qaRetest15At <= qaRetestSourceMssAt + 4 * 3600000 and (outDir == 1 ? qaRetest15Low <= qaRetest15Pivot and qaRetest15Close > qaRetest15Pivot : outDir == -1 ? qaRetest15High >= qaRetest15Pivot and qaRetest15Close < qaRetest15Pivot : false)
    bool retestVisible = outPhase == 2 and not na(qaRetestCycleC1) and qaRetestCycleC1 == outC1 and not na(verifiedM15At) and qaRetestSourceMssAt == verifiedM15At and not na(outM15Level) and qaRetest15Pivot == outM15Level and retestOHLCValid
    string outRetest15State = retestVisible ? "RETEST M15 QA" : outPhase == 2 and not na(verifiedM15At) ? "RETEST ESP" : "SIN MSS15"
    int outRetest15At = retestVisible ? qaRetest15At : na
    if retestVisible
        qaLastRetest15At := outRetest15At
    // Dentro de este modulo el Inside Bar H4 y su continuacion
    // permanecen experimentales, sin adjudicar un MSS de otro ciclo.
    string insideFamilyDiag = "NINGUNO"
    string insideStageDiag = "SIN INSIDE"
    int insideNum = array.size(insideCandidates)
    if insideNum > 0
        InsideCandidate insideLast = array.get(insideCandidates, insideNum - 1)
        insideFamilyDiag := insideLast.modelKind == "INSIDE_RETURN_BULL" or insideLast.modelKind == "INSIDE_RETURN_BEAR" ? "INSIDE RETURN" : insideLast.state == "CONTINUATION" ? "INSIDE CONTINUATION" : insideLast.state == "SEEKING" or insideLast.state == "SWEPT" ? "INSIDE PENDIENTE" : "INSIDE DESCARTADO"
        insideStageDiag := insideLast.state == "RATIFIED" ? "SOLO DIAGNOSTICO" : insideLast.state
    // QA: encontrar un Inside RATIFIED aun cuando un candidato SEEKING
    // posterior sea el ultimo del array. Expirar tras UNA H4.
    bool extraInside = false
    int extraInsideAt = na
    int extraInsideC1 = na
    int extraInsideDir = 0
    int extraInsideSweep = na
    float extraInsidePivot = na
    int extraInsidePivotAt = na
    int extraInsideMssAt = na
    float extraInsidePivot5 = na
    int extraInsidePivot5At = na
    int extraInsideMss5At = na
    if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0 and not na(barEnd)
        for ii = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
            InsideCandidate q = array.get(insideCandidates, ii)
            int closedAt = na(q.sweepH4Start) ? na : q.sweepH4Start + H4MS
            bool ratifiedNow = q.state == "RATIFIED" and q.isPatternValid and (q.sweepDir == 1 or q.sweepDir == -1) and not na(q.c1Start) and not na(q.sweepAt) and not na(closedAt) and barEnd >= closedAt and barEnd < closedAt + H4MS
            if ratifiedNow and (na(extraInsideAt) or closedAt >= extraInsideAt)
                extraInside := true
                extraInsideAt := closedAt
                extraInsideC1 := q.c1Start
                extraInsideDir := q.sweepDir
                extraInsideSweep := q.sweepAt
                extraInsidePivot := q.pivot15
                extraInsidePivotAt := q.pivot15At
                extraInsideMssAt := q.mss15At
                extraInsidePivot5 := q.pivot5
                extraInsidePivot5At := q.pivot5At
                extraInsideMss5At := q.mss5At
    // H4 auxiliares son mutuamente auditables, pero la UDT mantiene
    // SOLO el evento QA mas reciente: nunca atribuir MSS del CRT base.
    bool extraMulti = multiVisible and not na(qaMulti4C1) and (qaMulti4Kind == "MULTI4 BULL QA" or qaMulti4Kind == "MULTI4 BEAR QA")
    bool extraMultiN = not na(qaMultiNAt) and barEnd >= qaMultiNAt and barEnd - qaMultiNAt < H4MS and not na(qaMultiNC1) and (qaMultiNDir == 1 or qaMultiNDir == -1)
    // Solo un 3C TRUE con evidencia pre-sweep y C1/H4 propios puede
    // ocupar los campos QA de confirmacion; de otro modo permanece N/V.
    bool extraTrue3C = false
    if not na(qaTrue3CConfirmed) and not na(qaTrue3CSignedAt) and not na(barEnd)
        True3CMssCandidate q3 = qaTrue3CConfirmed
        extraTrue3C := q3.c3Start + H4MS == math.abs(qaTrue3CSignedAt) and q3.direction == (qaTrue3CSignedAt > 0 ? 1 : -1) and not q3.doubleSweep and not na(q3.sweepAt) and barEnd >= q3.c3Start + H4MS and barEnd < q3.c3Start + 2 * H4MS
    bool extraFamily = extraTrue3C or extraInside or extraMulti or extraMultiN
    bool extraSelectInside = not extraTrue3C and extraInside and (not extraMulti or extraInsideAt >= qaMulti4At) and (not extraMultiN or extraInsideAt >= qaMultiNAt)
    bool extraSelectMultiN = not extraTrue3C and not extraSelectInside and extraMultiN and (not extraMulti or qaMultiNAt >= qaMulti4At)
    string extraKind = not extraFamily ? "NONE" : extraTrue3C ? "3C TRUE QA" : extraSelectInside ? "INSIDE QA" : extraSelectMultiN ? "MULTI-N QA" : "MULTI4 QA"
    int extraC1 = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.c1Start : extraSelectInside ? extraInsideC1 : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNC1 : qaMulti4C1
    int extraDirection = not extraFamily ? 0 : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.direction : extraSelectInside ? extraInsideDir : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNDir : qaMulti4Kind == "MULTI4 BULL QA" ? 1 : -1
    int extraAt = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.c3Start + H4MS : extraSelectInside ? extraInsideAt : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNAt : qaMulti4At
    int extraSweepAt = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.sweepAt : extraSelectInside ? extraInsideSweep : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNSweepAt : qaMulti4SweepAt
    float extraPivot15 = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.pivot15 : extraSelectInside ? extraInsidePivot : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNPivot15 : qaMulti4Pivot15
    int extraPivotAt = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.pivot15At : extraSelectInside ? extraInsidePivotAt : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNPivot15At : qaMulti4Pivot15At
    int extraMssAt = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.mss15At : extraSelectInside ? extraInsideMssAt : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNMss15At : qaMulti4Mss15At
    float extraPivot5 = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.pivot5 : extraSelectInside ? extraInsidePivot5 : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNPivot5 : qaMulti4Pivot5
    int extraPivot5At = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.pivot5At : extraSelectInside ? extraInsidePivot5At : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNPivot5At : qaMulti4Pivot5At
    int extraMss5At = not extraFamily ? na : extraTrue3C ? qaTrue3CConfirmed.mss5At : extraSelectInside ? extraInsideMss5At : extraSelectMultiN ? qaMultiNMss5At : qaMulti4Mss5At
    bool extraMss5Causal = extraFamily and not na(extraC1) and not na(extraSweepAt) and not na(extraPivot5) and not na(extraPivot5At) and not na(extraMss5At) and extraPivot5At < extraSweepAt and extraMss5At > extraSweepAt and extraMss5At <= extraAt + H4MS and extraMss5At % MIN5 == qaNativeSourcePhaseMin * 60000
    // Distinta C1 y M15; no se hereda el pivote del CRT principal.
    bool extraMssCausal = extraFamily and not na(extraC1) and not na(extraSweepAt) and not na(extraPivot15) and not na(extraPivotAt) and not na(extraMssAt) and extraPivotAt < extraSweepAt and extraMssAt > extraSweepAt and extraMssAt <= lastCompleteM15CloseAt and f_m15_phase_ok(extraMssAt, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin) and extraMssAt <= extraAt + H4MS
    // Chart-level C1 evidence comes from the SAME f_engine M5 source.
    // Exactly one family can own these two prices. Priority will match the
    // owner monitor: current 2C > independent true3C > Inside/Multi QA.
    int familyC1At = na
    float familyC1Hi = na
    float familyC1Lo = na
    int familyEventAt = na
    int familyDir = 0
    string familyVisualKind = "NONE"
    bool ownTrue3CClosed = not na(qaTrue3CSignedAt) and not na(barEnd) and barEnd >= math.abs(qaTrue3CSignedAt) and barEnd < math.abs(qaTrue3CSignedAt) + H4MS
    if ownTrue3CClosed and array.size(qaMultiNHistory) >= 3
        for visI = 2 to array.size(qaMultiNHistory) - 1
            MultiH4 visC3 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, visI)
            if visC3.endAt == math.abs(qaTrue3CSignedAt)
                MultiH4 visC1 = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, visI - 2)
                familyC1At := visC1.startAt
                familyC1Hi := visC1.hi
                familyC1Lo := visC1.lo
                familyEventAt := visC3.endAt
                familyDir := qaTrue3CSignedAt > 0 ? 1 : -1
                familyVisualKind := "3C TRUE QA"
                break
    // If no true3C won, look up the exact C1 of the selected Extra
    // family. Different families cannot borrow the base 2C's CRH/CRL.
    if familyVisualKind == "NONE" and extraFamily and not na(extraC1)
        if extraSelectInside and array.size(insideCandidates) > 0
            for visI = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
                InsideCandidate visInside = array.get(insideCandidates, visI)
                if visInside.c1Start == extraC1 and visInside.state == "RATIFIED" and visInside.isPatternValid
                    familyC1At := visInside.c1Start
                    familyC1Hi := visInside.c1High
                    familyC1Lo := visInside.c1Low
                    familyEventAt := extraAt
                    familyDir := extraDirection
                    familyVisualKind := "INSIDE QA"
                    break
        else if extraSelectMultiN and array.size(qaMultiNHistory) > 0
            for visI = 0 to array.size(qaMultiNHistory) - 1
                MultiH4 visMultiN = array.get(qaMultiNHistory, visI)
                if visMultiN.startAt == extraC1 and visMultiN.valid
                    familyC1At := visMultiN.startAt
                    familyC1Hi := visMultiN.hi
                    familyC1Lo := visMultiN.lo
                    familyEventAt := extraAt
                    familyDir := extraDirection
                    familyVisualKind := "MULTI-N QA"
                    break
        else if array.size(qaFourH4) > 0
            for visI = 0 to array.size(qaFourH4) - 1
                MultiH4 visMulti4 = array.get(qaFourH4, visI)
                if visMulti4.startAt == extraC1 and visMulti4.valid
                    familyC1At := visMulti4.startAt
                    familyC1Hi := visMulti4.hi
                    familyC1Lo := visMulti4.lo
                    familyEventAt := extraAt
                    familyDir := extraDirection
                    familyVisualKind := "MULTI4 QA"
                    break
    bool familyHasOwnC1 = familyVisualKind != "NONE" and not na(familyC1At) and not na(familyC1Hi) and not na(familyC1Lo) and familyC1Hi > familyC1Lo and familyDir != 0 and not na(familyEventAt)
    FamilyVisual outFamilyVisual = FamilyVisual.new(familyC1At, familyC1Hi, familyC1Lo, familyEventAt, familyDir, familyVisualKind, familyHasOwnC1)
    // V34.11a: dedicated QA evidence for all SEVEN legacy category roles.
    // Inside CONTINUATION is an observed rejection, never a live CRT.
    bool insideContinuationNow = false
    if array.size(insideCandidates) > 0 and not na(barEnd)
        for catI = 0 to array.size(insideCandidates) - 1
            InsideCandidate q = array.get(insideCandidates, catI)
            int endOfInsideH4 = na(q.sweepH4Start) ? na : q.sweepH4Start + H4MS
            if q.state == "CONTINUATION" and not na(endOfInsideH4) and barEnd >= endOfInsideH4 and barEnd < endOfInsideH4 + H4MS
                insideContinuationNow := true
    // Bit 1 is the TRUE independent 3C: C2 setup, C3 sweep of C1.
    // Old category3C=outPhase==2 was merely the 2C pattern during C3.
    bool category2CActiveC3 = outPhase == 2 and outValid and outModel == "CRT_2C_RETURN"
    bool categoryTrue3C = not na(qaTrue3CSignedAt) and not na(barEnd) and barEnd >= math.abs(qaTrue3CSignedAt) and barEnd < math.abs(qaTrue3CSignedAt) + H4MS
    bool category2CPending = outPhase == 1 and not na(outC1)
    bool category2CExpansion = rejectedRecent
    bool categoryInsideReturn = extraInside
    bool categoryInsideContinuation = insideContinuationNow
    bool categoryMultiCandle = extraMulti or extraMultiN
    bool categoryM15Retest = retestVisible
    int qaCatalogMask = (categoryTrue3C ? 1 : 0) + (category2CPending ? 2 : 0) + (category2CExpansion ? 4 : 0) + (categoryInsideReturn ? 8 : 0) + (categoryInsideContinuation ? 16 : 0) + (categoryMultiCandle ? 32 : 0) + (categoryM15Retest ? 64 : 0)
    Signal.new(outPhase, outDir, outC1, outHi, outLo, outSweep, outM5At, verifiedM15At, outM5Level, outM15Level, outM5PivotAt, outM15PivotAt, outModel, outValid, outPdhStatus, outPdlStatus, pdhSweepAt, pdlSweepAt, pdhSweepStage, pdlSweepStage, pdhSweepC1, pdlSweepC1, outC2Start, outPhase == 2 ? c3Start : na, liquidityRefAt, pdhInDisplayedCRT, pdlInDisplayedCRT, qaCountH1, qaCodeH1, qaTopH1, qaBottomH1, qaPenH1, qaFormH1, qaGapH1, qaCountH4, qaCodeH4, qaTopH4, qaBottomH4, qaPenH4, qaFormH4, qaGapH4, bucketH4, h4Count, hasLiquidityRef ? prev_PDH : na, hasLiquidityRef ? prev_PDL : na, hasLiquidityRef ? prev_timestamp : na, currentChartDay, currentChartHigh, currentChartLow, currentChartContinuous, qaC1Ready, qaC2Ratified, qaLastC2Gate, not na(bucketH4) ? hour(bucketH4, TZ) : na, lastCompleteM15CloseAt, entryFamily, entryStage, entryConfirmedAt, insideFamilyDiag, insideStageDiag, outMulti4Kind, multiVisible ? qaMulti4At : na, outRetest15State, outRetest15At, retestVisible ? qaRetest15High : na, retestVisible ? qaRetest15Low : na, retestVisible ? qaRetest15Close : na, retestVisible ? qaRetest15Pivot : na, extraKind, extraFamily, extraC1, extraDirection, extraAt, extraMultiN ? qaMultiNKind : "MULTI-N ESP", extraMultiN ? qaMultiNAt : na, extraSweepAt, extraPivot15, extraPivotAt, extraMssCausal ? extraMssAt : na, extraC1, qaAudit2C, qaAudit3C, qaAuditInside, qaAuditM4, qaAuditMN, qaAuditC2Data, qaAuditC2Double, qaAuditC2NoSweep, qaAuditC2Outside, qaAuditC2Hour, qaAuditC3Invalid, qaAuditInsideData, qaAuditInsideDouble, qaAuditInsideOther, qaAuditInsideExpire, qaAuditMNNoTerminal, qaAuditMNDouble, qaAuditMNOutside, qaAuditH4Incomplete, qaAuditH4DST, qaAuditH4Session, qaAuditH4Internal, qaAuditC1H4Closed, qaAuditC1HourCandidates, qaAuditC1BadClock, qaAuditC1BadData, qaAuditC1BadRange, qaCatalogMask, qaH4BadStart, qaH4BadEnd, qaH4BadBars, qaH4LastBars, qaH4LastStartOffsetMin, qaH4LastEndOffsetMin, qaLastM5PhaseMin, qaNativeSourcePhaseMin, qaLastCandidate2CAt, qaLastRatified2CAt, qaLastRejectedExpansionAt, qaLastConfirmed3CAt, qaLastInsideReturnAt, qaLastInsideContinuationAt, qaLastMulti4At, qaLastMultiNAt, qaLastRetest15At, qaLastCandidate2CCycle, qaTrue3CSignedAt, outFamilyVisual, extraMss5Causal ? extraPivot5 : na, extraMss5Causal ? extraPivot5At : na, extraMss5Causal ? extraMss5At : na, extraMss5Causal ? extraC1 : na)

// V34.10c QA: f_engine se ejecuta EN TODAS las M5 para preservar
// acumuladores, pivotes, C1/C2/C3 y MSS. Solo se entrega la UDT
// del ultimo estado de la serie solicitada. No copia 42 campos de
// cada una de las 2500 velas a cada contexto del grafico.
f_engine_snapshot() =>
    Signal state = f_engine()
    barstate.islast ? state : na

// M4B: texto compacto y explicitamente vinculado al CRT MOSTRADO.
// PRE = primera barrida previa al comienzo de C2; OTR = fuera del
// ciclo C2/C3 mostrado. Evita atribuir al CRT una barrida ajena.
f_liqText(string status, int sweepAt, int stage, int sweepC1, int shownC1, int shownC2) =>
    string result = status == "N/D" ? "N/D" : status == "INTACTO" ? "INT" : "T OTR"
    if status == "TAKEN"
        if not na(shownC1) and sweepC1 == shownC1 and stage == 2
            result := "T C2"
        else if not na(shownC1) and sweepC1 == shownC1 and stage == 3
            result := "T C3"
        else if not na(shownC2) and not na(sweepAt) and sweepAt <= shownC2
            result := "T PRE"
    result

f_liqColor(string status) =>
    status == "TAKEN" ? color.rgb(237, 164, 83) : status == "INTACTO" ? color.rgb(97, 192, 152) : color.gray

